          "level": "warning",
          "rank": 27.33,
          "message": {
            "text": "[需修改] SynchronizeCoreAsync — CPS=70.0% (C=86.8%, P=55.8%). 复杂度较高（56 > 基线 P90 14，圈复杂度 39） 可维护性指数偏低（MI=13.7） 外部依赖耦合较高（扇出 44） 函数长度（310 行）超过 C# P90 基线（50 行） 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 56，310 行） 新增抛出异常（`IosNotificationSynchronizationDeferredException`, `IosNotificationSynchronizationRollbackException`），可能影响 1 个上游调用方 修复: 使用提前返回减少条件嵌套。 拆分职责以降低单函数外部依赖数量。 将 `SynchronizeCoreAsync` 拆分为更小的子函数（建议 < 50 行）。 为 `SynchronizeCoreAsync` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。",
            "markdown": "**需修改** — `SynchronizeCoreAsync` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosLessonNotificationScheduler.cs:L51-L388`) · **CPS `70.0%`** (C `86.8%`, P `55.8%`, 权重 `0.2%`)\n- **问题:** 复杂度较高（56 > 基线 P90 14，圈复杂度 39）\n- **问题:** 可维护性指数偏低（MI=13.7）\n- **问题:** 外部依赖耦合较高（扇出 44）\n- **问题:** 函数长度（310 行）超过 C# P90 基线（50 行）\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 56，310 行）\n- **问题:** 新增抛出异常（`IosNotificationSynchronizationDeferredException`, `IosNotificationSynchronizationRollbackException`），可能影响 1 个上游调用方\n- **修复:** 使用提前返回减少条件嵌套。\n- **修复:** 拆分职责以降低单函数外部依赖数量。\n- **修复:** 将 `SynchronizeCoreAsync` 拆分为更小的子函数（建议 < 50 行）。\n- **修复:** 为 `SynchronizeCoreAsync` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。\n- **修复:** 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosLessonNotificationScheduler.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 115
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 51,
                  "endLine": 388,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private async Task<IosLessonNotificationSynchronizationResult> SynchronizeCoreAsync(\n        IReadOnlyCollection<IosLessonNotificationRequest> requests,\n        bool allowLargeMutations,\n        CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n    {\n        var notificationCenter = UNUserNotificationCenter.Current;\n        var pending = await notificationCenter.GetPendingNotificationRequestsAsync() ?? [];\n        cancellationToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();\n\n        var distinctCandidates = requests\n            .GroupBy(x => x.Identifier, StringComparer.Ordinal)\n            .Select(x => x.First())\n            .ToArray();\n        var pendingByIdentifier = pending\n            .GroupBy(x => x.Identifier, StringComparer.Ordinal)\n            .ToDictionary(x => x.Key, x => x.First(), StringComparer.Ordinal);\n        var pendingIdentifiers = pendingByIdentifier.Keys\n            .ToHashSet(StringComparer.Ordinal);\n        var systemNow = DateTimeOffset.Now;\n        var capacitySelection = SelectForAvailableCapacity("
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 51,
                  "endLine": 388,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +50,340 @@\n+\n+    private async Task<IosLessonNotificationSynchronizationResult> SynchronizeCoreAsync(\n+        IReadOnlyCollection<IosLessonNotificationRequest> requests,\n+        bool allowLargeMutations,\n+        CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n+    {\n+        var notificationCenter = UNUserNotificationCenter.Current;\n+        var pending = await notificationCenter.GetPendingNotificationRequestsAsync() ?? [];\n+        cancellationToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();\n+\n+        var distinctCandidates = requests\n+            .GroupBy(x => x.Identifier, StringComparer.Ordinal)\n+            .Select(x => x.First())\n+            .ToArray();\n+        var pendingByIdentifier = pending\n+            .GroupBy(x => x.Identifier, StringComparer.Ordinal)\n+            .ToDictionary(x => x.Key, x => x.First(), StringComparer.Ordinal);\n+        var pendingIdentifiers = pendingByIdentifier.Keys\n+            .ToHashSet(StringComparer.Ordinal);\n+        var systemNow = DateTimeOffset.Now;\n+        var capacitySelection = SelectForAvailableCapacity(\n+            distinctCandidates,\n+            pending,\n+            systemNow);\n+        var distinctRequests = capacitySelection.Requests"
                  }
                }
              },
