            "markdown": "**需修改** — `AddDayRequests` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosLessonNotificationScheduleFactory.cs:L205-L374`) · **CPS `76.1%`** (C `89.5%`, P `64.4%`, 权重 `0.2%`)\n- **问题:** 复杂度较高（43 > 基线 P90 14，圈复杂度 24）\n- **问题:** 控制流嵌套过深（层级 4）\n- **问题:** 外部依赖耦合较高（扇出 18）\n- **问题:** 函数长度（163 行）超过 C# P90 基线（50 行）\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 43，163 行）\n- **修复:** 使用提前返回减少条件嵌套。\n- **修复:** 扁平化多层条件分支。\n- **修复:** 拆分职责以降低单函数外部依赖数量。\n- **修复:** 将 `AddDayRequests` 拆分为更小的子函数（建议 < 50 行）。\n- **修复:** 为 `AddDayRequests` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosLessonNotificationScheduleFactory.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 114
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 205,
                  "endLine": 374,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void AddDayRequests(\n        ICollection<IosLessonNotificationRequest> requests,\n        IDictionary<string, PreparationCandidate> preparationCandidates,\n        ClassPlan classPlan,\n        DateTime date,\n        DateTime logicalNow,\n        DateTimeOffset systemNow,\n        ClassNotificationSettings providerSettings)\n    {\n        var timeLayout = classPlan.TimeLayout!;\n        var validItems = classPlan.ValidTimeLayoutItems\n            .Where(x => x.TimeType is 0 or 1)\n            .OrderBy(x => x.StartTime)\n            .ThenBy(x => x.EndTime)\n            .ToArray();\n        var allClassItems = timeLayout.Layouts\n            .Where(x => x.TimeType == 0)\n            .ToArray();\n        var lessons = new List<LessonEntry>();\n"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 205,
                  "endLine": 374,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +204,172 @@\n+\n+    private void AddDayRequests(\n+        ICollection<IosLessonNotificationRequest> requests,\n+        IDictionary<string, PreparationCandidate> preparationCandidates,\n+        ClassPlan classPlan,\n+        DateTime date,\n+        DateTime logicalNow,\n+        DateTimeOffset systemNow,\n+        ClassNotificationSettings providerSettings)\n+    {\n+        var timeLayout = classPlan.TimeLayout!;\n+        var validItems = classPlan.ValidTimeLayoutItems\n+            .Where(x => x.TimeType is 0 or 1)\n+            .OrderBy(x => x.StartTime)\n+            .ThenBy(x => x.EndTime)\n+            .ToArray();\n+        var allClassItems = timeLayout.Layouts\n+            .Where(x => x.TimeType == 0)\n+            .ToArray();\n+        var lessons = new List<LessonEntry>();\n+\n+        foreach (var item in validItems.Where(x => x.TimeType == 0))\n+        {\n+            var classIndex = Array.IndexOf(allClassItems, item);\n+            if (classIndex < 0 ||\n+                classIndex >= classPlan.Classes.Count ||\n+                !classPlan.Classes[classIndex].IsEnabled ||\n+                item.EndTime <= item.StartTime)\n+            {\n+                continue;\n+            }\n+\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
