            "markdown": "**提示** — `ArmFirstTapStart` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosPipOverlayService.cs:L426-L442`) · **CPS `83.1%`** (C `87.2%`, P `79.1%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia`（`window`）\n- **问题:** 跨层依赖：`services` 层引用了上层 `views/ui` 的 `Avalonia.Controls` (`window`)\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosPipOverlayService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 125
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 426,
                  "endLine": 442,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void ArmFirstTapStart(UIWindow window)\n    {\n        if (_firstTapRecognizer != null)\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        // 只旁听点击，不拦截、不延迟应用自己的触摸处理。\n        _firstTapRecognizer = new UITapGestureRecognizer(OnFirstTap)\n        {\n            CancelsTouchesInView = false,\n            DelaysTouchesBegan = false,\n            DelaysTouchesEnded = false,\n            ShouldRecognizeSimultaneously = (_, _) => true\n        };\n        window.AddGestureRecognizer(_firstTapRecognizer);\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 426,
                  "endLine": 442,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +425,19 @@\n+\n+    private void ArmFirstTapStart(UIWindow window)\n+    {\n+        if (_firstTapRecognizer != null)\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        // 只旁听点击，不拦截、不延迟应用自己的触摸处理。\n+        _firstTapRecognizer = new UITapGestureRecognizer(OnFirstTap)\n+        {\n+            CancelsTouchesInView = false,\n+            DelaysTouchesBegan = false,\n+            DelaysTouchesEnded = false,\n+            ShouldRecognizeSimultaneously = (_, _) => true\n+        };\n+        window.AddGestureRecognizer(_firstTapRecognizer);\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
