            "markdown": "**提示** — `CreateHost` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosPipOverlayService.cs:L207-L236`) · **CPS `83.7%`** (C `88.9%`, P `78.7%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia`（`TopLevel`）\n- **问题:** 跨层依赖：`services` 层引用了上层 `views/ui` 的 `Avalonia.Controls` (`TopLevel`)\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosPipOverlayService.cs",
