          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] InspectEntry — CPS=84.8% (C=83.1%, P=86.6%). 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 9，39 行） 新增抛出异常（`InvalidDataException`），可能影响 1 个上游调用方 修复: 为 `InspectEntry` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `InspectEntry` (`ClassIsland/Services/SafeArchiveExtractor.cs:L58-L101`) · **CPS `84.8%`** (C `83.1%`, P `86.6%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 9，39 行）\n- **问题:** 新增抛出异常（`InvalidDataException`），可能影响 1 个上游调用方\n- **修复:** 为 `InspectEntry` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。\n- **修复:** 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Services/SafeArchiveExtractor.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 181
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 58,
                  "endLine": 101,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private static InspectedArchiveEntry InspectEntry(\n        ZipArchiveEntry entry,\n        string destinationRoot,\n        IReadOnlySet<string> allowedFiles,\n        IReadOnlySet<string> allowedDirectories)\n    {\n        var normalized = SafeArchivePath.NormalizeRelativePath(entry.FullName);\n        var isDirectory = normalized.EndsWith(\"/\", StringComparison.Ordinal);\n        var segments = normalized.TrimEnd('/').Split('/');\n        var firstSegment = segments[0];\n\n        if (IsSymbolicLink(entry))\n        {\n            throw new InvalidDataException(\n                $\"归档包含不支持的符号链接：{entry.FullName}\");\n        }\n\n        var isAllowedFile = segments.Length == 1 &&\n                            !isDirectory &&\n                            allowedFiles.Contains(firstSegment);"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 58,
                  "endLine": 101,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +57,46 @@\n+\n+    private static InspectedArchiveEntry InspectEntry(\n+        ZipArchiveEntry entry,\n+        string destinationRoot,\n+        IReadOnlySet<string> allowedFiles,\n+        IReadOnlySet<string> allowedDirectories)\n+    {\n+        var normalized = SafeArchivePath.NormalizeRelativePath(entry.FullName);\n+        var isDirectory = normalized.EndsWith(\"/\", StringComparison.Ordinal);\n+        var segments = normalized.TrimEnd('/').Split('/');\n+        var firstSegment = segments[0];\n+\n+        if (IsSymbolicLink(entry))\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidDataException(\n+                $\"归档包含不支持的符号链接：{entry.FullName}\");\n+        }\n+\n+        var isAllowedFile = segments.Length == 1 &&\n+                            !isDirectory &&\n+                            allowedFiles.Contains(firstSegment);\n+        var isAllowedDirectory = allowedDirectories.Contains(firstSegment);\n+        if (isAllowedDirectory && segments.Length == 1 && !isDirectory)\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidDataException(\n+                $\"归档目录 {firstSegment} 被存储为普通文件。\");\n+        }\n+\n+        if (allowedFiles.Contains(firstSegment) &&\n+            (segments.Length != 1 || isDirectory))"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
