            "markdown": "**提示** — `RunMainViewCommandAsync` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/SystemIntegration/IosSystemNavigationService.cs:L83-L99`) · **CPS `84.9%`** (C `91.1%`, P `79.1%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层依赖：`services` 层引用了上层 `views/ui` 的 `ClassIsland.Controls.UI`\n- **问题:** 跨层依赖：`services` 层引用了上层 `views/ui` 的 `ClassIsland.Core.Controls`\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/SystemIntegration/IosSystemNavigationService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 142
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 83,
                  "endLine": 99,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "public async Task RunMainViewCommandAsync(Func<MainView, Task> command)\n    {\n        await _navigationGate.WaitAsync();\n        try\n        {\n            await command(await ShowMainViewAsync());\n        }\n        catch (Exception exception)\n        {\n            Console.Error.WriteLine($\"无法执行菜单命令：{exception}\");\n            await CommonTaskDialogs.ShowDialog(\"操作未完成\", \"请返回 ClassIsland 重试，或从应用内打开相应功能。\");\n        }\n        finally\n        {\n            _navigationGate.Release();\n        }\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 83,
                  "endLine": 99,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +82,19 @@\n+    /// </summary>\n+    public async Task RunMainViewCommandAsync(Func<MainView, Task> command)\n+    {\n+        await _navigationGate.WaitAsync();\n+        try\n+        {\n+            await command(await ShowMainViewAsync());\n+        }\n+        catch (Exception exception)\n+        {\n+            Console.Error.WriteLine($\"无法执行菜单命令：{exception}\");\n+            await CommonTaskDialogs.ShowDialog(\"操作未完成\", \"请返回 ClassIsland 重试，或从应用内打开相应功能。\");\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            _navigationGate.Release();\n+        }\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
