            "markdown": "**提示** — `OpenPersistentFoldersPickerAsync` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Platform/IosPlatformFilePickerService.cs:L94-L103`) · **CPS `85.2%`** (C `86.5%`, P `83.9%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层依赖：`services` 层引用了上层 `views/ui` 的 `Avalonia.Controls` (`TopLevel`)\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia.Platform.Storage`（`TopLevel`）\n- **问题:** 疑似重复实现：`OpenPersistentFoldersPickerAsync` 与上游 `OpenFoldersPickerAsync` (`ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Stubs/Services/AvaloniaDefaultPlatformFilePickerService.cs:L151-L175`) 相似度 90.4%\n- **问题:** 重复函数签名：`public async Task<List<string>> OpenPersistentFoldersPickerAsync( FolderPickerOpenOptions options, TopLevel root)` 与上游 `OpenFoldersPickerAsync` (`ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Stubs/Services/AvaloniaDefaultPlatformFilePickerService.cs:L151-L175`) 冲突\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。\n- **修复:** 建议直接复用或扩展 `ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Stubs/Services/AvaloniaDefaultPlatformFilePickerService.cs` 中的 `OpenFoldersPickerAsync`。"
          },
