            "markdown": "**提示** — `AccountBytes` (`ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/StorageItemMaterializer.cs:L383-L399`) · **CPS `85.3%`** (C `80.3%`, P `90.6%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 新增抛出异常（`IOException`），可能影响 1 个上游调用方\n- **修复:** 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/StorageItemMaterializer.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 81
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 383,
                  "endLine": 399,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "public void AccountBytes(ref long fileLength, int bytesRead)\n        {\n            if (fileLength > maximumFileLength - bytesRead)\n            {\n                throw new IOException(\n                    $\"选中的单个文件大小超过上限 {maximumFileLength} 字节，无法安全导入。\");\n            }\n\n            if (_totalLength > maximumTotalLength - bytesRead)\n            {\n                throw new IOException(\n                    $\"选中文件的总大小超过上限 {maximumTotalLength} 字节，无法安全导入。\");\n            }\n\n            fileLength += bytesRead;\n            _totalLength += bytesRead;\n        }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 383,
                  "endLine": 399,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +382,19 @@\n+\n+        public void AccountBytes(ref long fileLength, int bytesRead)\n+        {\n+            if (fileLength > maximumFileLength - bytesRead)\n+            {\n+                throw new IOException(\n+                    $\"选中的单个文件大小超过上限 {maximumFileLength} 字节，无法安全导入。\");\n+            }\n+\n+            if (_totalLength > maximumTotalLength - bytesRead)\n+            {\n+                throw new IOException(\n+                    $\"选中文件的总大小超过上限 {maximumTotalLength} 字节，无法安全导入。\");\n+            }\n+\n+            fileLength += bytesRead;\n+            _totalLength += bytesRead;\n+        }\n+    }"
                  }
                }
              },
