          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] lessonList — CPS=85.4% (C=85.3%, P=85.5%). 控制流嵌套过深（层级 5） 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 8，22 行） 修复: 扁平化多层条件分支。 为 `lessonList` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `lessonList` (`ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Extension/ClassIslandScheduleWidget.swift:L252-L273`) · **CPS `85.4%`** (C `85.3%`, P `85.5%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 控制流嵌套过深（层级 5）\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 8，22 行）\n- **修复:** 扁平化多层条件分支。\n- **修复:** 为 `lessonList` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Extension/ClassIslandScheduleWidget.swift",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 99
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 252,
                  "endLine": 273,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@ViewBuilder\n    private func lessonList(_ lessons: [ClassIslandSystemLesson], emptyText: String) -> some View {\n        let visible = Array(lessons.prefix(family == .systemLarge ? 7 : 3))\n        if visible.isEmpty {\n            Text(emptyText).font(.caption).foregroundStyle(.secondary)\n        } else {\n            ForEach(visible) { lesson in\n                Link(destination: lesson.deepLink ?? ClassIslandSystemSnapshotStore.scheduleURL) {\n                    HStack(spacing: 8) {\n                        Text(lesson.startDate, style: .time).monospacedDigit().foregroundStyle(.secondary)\n                        Text(lesson.subject).lineLimit(1)\n                        Spacer(minLength: 0)\n                        if family == .systemLarge && !lesson.location.isEmpty {\n                            Text(lesson.location).foregroundStyle(.secondary).lineLimit(1)\n                        }\n                    }\n                    .font(.caption)\n                }\n                .buttonStyle(.plain)\n            }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 252,
                  "endLine": 273,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +251,24 @@\n+\n+    @ViewBuilder\n+    private func lessonList(_ lessons: [ClassIslandSystemLesson], emptyText: String) -> some View {\n+        let visible = Array(lessons.prefix(family == .systemLarge ? 7 : 3))\n+        if visible.isEmpty {\n+            Text(emptyText).font(.caption).foregroundStyle(.secondary)\n+        } else {\n+            ForEach(visible) { lesson in\n+                Link(destination: lesson.deepLink ?? ClassIslandSystemSnapshotStore.scheduleURL) {\n+                    HStack(spacing: 8) {\n+                        Text(lesson.startDate, style: .time).monospacedDigit().foregroundStyle(.secondary)\n+                        Text(lesson.subject).lineLimit(1)\n+                        Spacer(minLength: 0)\n+                        if family == .systemLarge && !lesson.location.isEmpty {\n+                            Text(lesson.location).foregroundStyle(.secondary).lineLimit(1)\n+                        }\n+                    }\n+                    .font(.caption)\n+                }\n+                .buttonStyle(.plain)\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
