          "level": "note",
          "rank": 12.75,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] ci_hud_stop — CPS=86.0% (C=82.5%, P=89.6%). 标识符 `ci_hud_stop` (snake) 不符合 `camel` 命名规范 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 12，22 行） 修复: 将 `ci_hud_stop` 调整为 `camel` 命名格式。 为 `ci_hud_stop` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `ci_hud_stop` (`ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Bridge/ClassIslandHudBridge.swift:L355-L378`) · **CPS `86.0%`** (C `82.5%`, P `89.6%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 标识符 `ci_hud_stop` (snake) 不符合 `camel` 命名规范\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 12，22 行）\n- **修复:** 将 `ci_hud_stop` 调整为 `camel` 命名格式。\n- **修复:** 为 `ci_hud_stop` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Bridge/ClassIslandHudBridge.swift",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 92
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 355,
                  "endLine": 378,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@_cdecl(\"ci_hud_stop\")\npublic func ci_hud_stop() -> Int32 {\n    hudStateLock.lock()\n    defer { hudStateLock.unlock() }\n\n    let pid = hudResolveRunningPidLocked()\n    guard pid > 0 else {\n        hudRemoveMarker()\n        hudChildPid = 0\n        hudClearLastError()\n        return 0\n    }\n\n    switch hudTerminateProcess(pid) {\n    case .terminated, .alreadyGone:\n        hudRemoveMarker()\n        hudChildPid = 0\n        hudClearLastError()\n        return 1\n    case let .forbidden(reason):"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 355,
                  "endLine": 378,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +354,26 @@\n+\n+@_cdecl(\"ci_hud_stop\")\n+public func ci_hud_stop() -> Int32 {\n+    hudStateLock.lock()\n+    defer { hudStateLock.unlock() }\n+\n+    let pid = hudResolveRunningPidLocked()\n+    guard pid > 0 else {\n+        hudRemoveMarker()\n+        hudChildPid = 0\n+        hudClearLastError()\n+        return 0\n+    }\n+\n+    switch hudTerminateProcess(pid) {\n+    case .terminated, .alreadyGone:\n+        hudRemoveMarker()\n+        hudChildPid = 0\n+        hudClearLastError()\n+        return 1\n+    case let .forbidden(reason):\n+        hudSetLastError(\"ci_hud_stop: HUD 进程 (pid=\\(pid)) 无法终止：\\(reason)。\")\n+        return HudError.terminationForbidden.rawValue\n+    }\n+}\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "ci_hud_stop",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Bridge/ClassIslandHudBridge.swift::ci_hud_stop",
                  "kind": "function"
                }
              ]
            }
