            "markdown": "**提示** — `ShowMainViewAsync` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/SystemIntegration/IosSystemNavigationService.cs:L101-L108`) · **CPS `86.1%`** (C `92.6%`, P `79.9%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia.Threading`（`Dispatcher, DispatcherPriority`）\n- **问题:** 跨层依赖：`services` 层引用了上层 `views/ui` 的 `ClassIsland.Controls.UI` (`Dispatcher`)\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/SystemIntegration/IosSystemNavigationService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 142
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 101,
                  "endLine": 108,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private async Task<MainView> ShowMainViewAsync()\n    {\n        var view = viewHost.CurrentView as MainView ?? IAppHost.GetService<MainView>();\n        if (!ReferenceEquals(viewHost.CurrentView, view)) view.Open();\n        // 首次打开页面时先让宿主完成挂载，再切换页面、日期或打开抽屉。\n        await Dispatcher.UIThread.InvokeAsync(() => { }, DispatcherPriority.Loaded);\n        return view;\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 101,
                  "endLine": 108,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +100,10 @@\n+\n+    private async Task<MainView> ShowMainViewAsync()\n+    {\n+        var view = viewHost.CurrentView as MainView ?? IAppHost.GetService<MainView>();\n+        if (!ReferenceEquals(viewHost.CurrentView, view)) view.Open();\n+        // 首次打开页面时先让宿主完成挂载，再切换页面、日期或打开抽屉。\n+        await Dispatcher.UIThread.InvokeAsync(() => { }, DispatcherPriority.Loaded);\n+        return view;\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
