          "rank": 12.29,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] SaveFileAsync — CPS=86.5% (C=87.3%, P=85.8%). 跨层依赖：`domain/models` 层引用了上层 `views/ui` 的 `Avalonia.Controls` (`TopLevel`) 跨层耦合：`domain/models` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia.Platform.Storage`（`TopLevel`） 修复: 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `SaveFileAsync` (`ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Stubs/Services/AvaloniaDefaultPlatformFilePickerService.cs:L186-L213`) · **CPS `86.5%`** (C `87.3%`, P `85.8%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层依赖：`domain/models` 层引用了上层 `views/ui` 的 `Avalonia.Controls` (`TopLevel`)\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`domain/models` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia.Platform.Storage`（`TopLevel`）\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Stubs/Services/AvaloniaDefaultPlatformFilePickerService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 85
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 186,
                  "endLine": 213,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "public virtual async Task<string?> SaveFileAsync(\n        FilePickerSaveOptions options,\n        TopLevel root,\n        Func<Stream, Task> writer)\n    {\n        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(options);\n        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(root);\n        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(writer);\n\n        using var file = await root.StorageProvider.SaveFilePickerAsync(options);\n        if (file == null)\n        {\n            return null;\n        }\n\n        await using (var output = await file.OpenWriteAsync())\n        {\n            if (output.CanSeek)\n            {\n                output.SetLength(0);"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 186,
                  "endLine": 213,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -150,2 +185,30 @@ public class AvaloniaDefaultPlatformFilePickerService : IPlatformFilePickerServi\n     /// <inheritdoc />\n-    public async Task<List<string>> OpenFoldersPickerAsync(FolderPickerOpenOptions options, TopLevel root)\n+    public virtual async Task<string?> SaveFileAsync(\n+        FilePickerSaveOptions options,\n+        TopLevel root,\n+        Func<Stream, Task> writer)\n+    {\n+        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(options);\n+        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(root);\n+        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(writer);\n+\n+        using var file = await root.StorageProvider.SaveFilePickerAsync(options);\n+        if (file == null)\n+        {\n+            return null;\n+        }\n+\n+        await using (var output = await file.OpenWriteAsync())\n+        {\n+            if (output.CanSeek)\n+            {\n+                output.SetLength(0);\n+            }\n+\n+            await writer(output);\n+            await output.FlushAsync();\n+        }\n+\n+        return file.TryGetLocalPath() ?? file.Name;\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "SaveFileAsync",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Stubs/Services/AvaloniaDefaultPlatformFilePickerService.cs::SaveFileAsync",
                  "kind": "function"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "primaryLocationLineHash": "5c2fe38c79bc95c588c91b8c"
          },
          "properties": {
            "status": "ADVISORY",
