          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] LaunchFile — CPS=86.5% (C=90.3%, P=82.8%). 跨层依赖：`services` 层引用了上层 `views/ui` 的 `Avalonia.Controls` (`Dispatcher`) 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia.Threading`（`Dispatcher, Window`） 修复: 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `LaunchFile` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Platform/IosLauncherService.cs:L42-L82`) · **CPS `86.5%`** (C `90.3%`, P `82.8%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层依赖：`services` 层引用了上层 `views/ui` 的 `Avalonia.Controls` (`Dispatcher`)\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia.Threading`（`Dispatcher, Window`）\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Platform/IosLauncherService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 131
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 42,
                  "endLine": 82,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "public async Task LaunchFile(string path)\n    {\n        path = ImportedFileReference.Resolve(path);\n        if (!File.Exists(path))\n        {\n            throw new FileNotFoundException(\"找不到要预览的文件，请在行动设置中重新选择文件。\");\n        }\n\n        var fullPath = Path.GetFullPath(path);\n        await Dispatcher.UIThread.InvokeAsync(async () =>\n        {\n            if (UIApplication.SharedApplication.ApplicationState != UIApplicationState.Active)\n            {\n                throw new InvalidOperationException(\"请返回 ClassIsland 后重新运行文件预览行动。\");\n            }\n\n            var root = AppBase.Current.GetRootWindow();\n            var handle = root.TryGetPlatformHandle();\n            var view = handle == null ? null : Runtime.GetNSObject<UIView>(handle.Handle);\n            var controller = view?.Window?.RootViewController"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 42,
                  "endLine": 82,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +41,43 @@\n+\n+    public async Task LaunchFile(string path)\n+    {\n+        path = ImportedFileReference.Resolve(path);\n+        if (!File.Exists(path))\n+        {\n+            throw new FileNotFoundException(\"找不到要预览的文件，请在行动设置中重新选择文件。\");\n+        }\n+\n+        var fullPath = Path.GetFullPath(path);\n+        await Dispatcher.UIThread.InvokeAsync(async () =>\n+        {\n+            if (UIApplication.SharedApplication.ApplicationState != UIApplicationState.Active)\n+            {\n+                throw new InvalidOperationException(\"请返回 ClassIsland 后重新运行文件预览行动。\");\n+            }\n+\n+            var root = AppBase.Current.GetRootWindow();\n+            var handle = root.TryGetPlatformHandle();\n+            var view = handle == null ? null : Runtime.GetNSObject<UIView>(handle.Handle);\n+            var controller = view?.Window?.RootViewController\n+                             ?? throw new InvalidOperationException(\"暂时无法显示文件预览，请返回主界面后重试。\");\n+            if (controller.PresentedViewController != null || _previewController != null)\n+            {\n+                throw new InvalidOperationException(\"请先关闭当前系统窗口或文件预览，再运行此行动。\");\n+            }\n+\n+            // Quick Look 的 dataSource 为弱引用"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
