            "markdown": "**提示** — `SettingsServiceOnPropertyChanged` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosPipOverlayService.cs:L495-L513`) · **CPS `86.7%`** (C `94.4%`, P `79.5%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia`（`Dispatcher`）\n- **问题:** 跨层依赖：`services` 层引用了上层 `views/ui` 的 `Avalonia.Controls` (`Dispatcher`)\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosPipOverlayService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 125
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 495,
                  "endLine": 513,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void SettingsServiceOnPropertyChanged(object? sender, PropertyChangedEventArgs e)\n    {\n        // 导入或恢复配置会替换整个 Settings 对象；主界面岛在构造时绑定 Settings，需要重建。\n        if (e.PropertyName != nameof(SettingsService.Settings) || !_isEnabled)\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        Dispatcher.UIThread.Post(() =>\n        {\n            if (!_isEnabled)\n            {\n                return;\n            }\n\n            DestroyHost();\n            CreateHost();\n        });\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 495,
                  "endLine": 513,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +494,21 @@\n+\n+    private void SettingsServiceOnPropertyChanged(object? sender, PropertyChangedEventArgs e)\n+    {\n+        // 导入或恢复配置会替换整个 Settings 对象；主界面岛在构造时绑定 Settings，需要重建。\n+        if (e.PropertyName != nameof(SettingsService.Settings) || !_isEnabled)\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        Dispatcher.UIThread.Post(() =>\n+        {\n+            if (!_isEnabled)\n+            {\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            DestroyHost();\n+            CreateHost();\n+        });\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
