            "markdown": "**提示** — `GetUpcomingClassPreparationTime` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosLessonNotificationScheduleFactory.cs:L126-L193`) · **CPS `86.8%`** (C `91.9%`, P `81.9%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 函数长度（64 行）超过 C# P90 基线（50 行）\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 11，64 行）\n- **问题:** 跨层类型引用：`services` 层引用了 `views/ui` 层的 `Empty`（`ClassIsland.Core/Controls/Empty.axaml.cs`）\n- **问题:** 疑似重复实现：`GetUpcomingClassPreparationTime` 与上游 `GetPreparingNotificationTargetTime` (`ClassIsland/ViewModels/DevPortalViewModel.cs:L31-L92`) 相似度 90.8%\n- **修复:** 将 `GetUpcomingClassPreparationTime` 拆分为更小的子函数（建议 < 50 行）。\n- **修复:** 为 `GetUpcomingClassPreparationTime` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。\n- **修复:** 建议直接复用或扩展 `ClassIsland/ViewModels/DevPortalViewModel.cs` 中的 `GetPreparingNotificationTargetTime`。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosLessonNotificationScheduleFactory.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 114
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 126,
                  "endLine": 193,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "internal DateTimeOffset? GetUpcomingClassPreparationTime()\n    {\n        if (!AreLessonNotificationsEnabled())\n        {\n            return null;\n        }\n\n        var classPlan = lessonsService.CurrentClassPlan;\n        var timeLayout = classPlan?.TimeLayout;\n        var nextItem = lessonsService.NextClassTimeLayoutItem;\n        if (classPlan is not { IsEnabled: true } ||\n            timeLayout == null ||\n            ReferenceEquals(nextItem, TimeLayoutItem.Empty) ||\n            nextItem.EndTime <= nextItem.StartTime)\n        {\n            return null;\n        }\n\n        var subject = lessonsService.NextClassSubject;\n        var allClassItems = timeLayout.Layouts"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 126,
                  "endLine": 193,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +125,70 @@\n+    /// </summary>\n+    internal DateTimeOffset? GetUpcomingClassPreparationTime()\n+    {\n+        if (!AreLessonNotificationsEnabled())\n+        {\n+            return null;\n+        }\n+\n+        var classPlan = lessonsService.CurrentClassPlan;\n+        var timeLayout = classPlan?.TimeLayout;\n+        var nextItem = lessonsService.NextClassTimeLayoutItem;\n+        if (classPlan is not { IsEnabled: true } ||\n+            timeLayout == null ||\n+            ReferenceEquals(nextItem, TimeLayoutItem.Empty) ||\n+            nextItem.EndTime <= nextItem.StartTime)\n+        {\n+            return null;\n+        }\n+\n+        var subject = lessonsService.NextClassSubject;\n+        var allClassItems = timeLayout.Layouts\n+            .Where(x => x.TimeType == 0)\n+            .ToArray();\n+        var classIndex = Array.IndexOf(allClassItems, nextItem);\n+        if (classIndex < 0)\n+        {\n+            return null;\n+        }\n+\n+        var attachedSettings = IAttachedSettingsHostService\n+            .GetAttachedSettingsByPriority<ClassNotificationAttachedSettings>(\n+                ProviderGuid,\n+                subject,\n+                nextItem,\n+                classPlan"
                  }
                }
              },
