            "markdown": "**提示** — `IsWindowsReservedName` (`ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/SafeArchivePath.cs:L96-L107`) · **CPS `86.9%`** (C `85.8%`, P `88.1%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 7，12 行）\n- **修复:** 为 `IsWindowsReservedName` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/SafeArchivePath.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 77
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 96,
                  "endLine": 107,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private static bool IsWindowsReservedName(string segment)\n    {\n        var stem = segment.Split('.', 2)[0];\n        return stem.Equals(\"CON\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) ||\n               stem.Equals(\"PRN\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) ||\n               stem.Equals(\"AUX\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) ||\n               stem.Equals(\"NUL\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) ||\n               stem.Length == 4 &&\n               (stem.StartsWith(\"COM\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) ||\n                stem.StartsWith(\"LPT\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)) &&\n               stem[3] is >= '1' and <= '9';\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 96,
                  "endLine": 107,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +95,14 @@\n+\n+    private static bool IsWindowsReservedName(string segment)\n+    {\n+        var stem = segment.Split('.', 2)[0];\n+        return stem.Equals(\"CON\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) ||\n+               stem.Equals(\"PRN\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) ||\n+               stem.Equals(\"AUX\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) ||\n+               stem.Equals(\"NUL\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) ||\n+               stem.Length == 4 &&\n+               (stem.StartsWith(\"COM\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) ||\n+                stem.StartsWith(\"LPT\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)) &&\n+               stem[3] is >= '1' and <= '9';\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "IsWindowsReservedName",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/SafeArchivePath.cs::IsWindowsReservedName",
