            "markdown": "**提示** — `GetUniquePath` (`ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/StorageItemMaterializer.cs:L313-L331`) · **CPS `86.9%`** (C `82.5%`, P `91.5%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 重复函数签名：`private static string GetUniquePath(string directory, string name)` 与上游 `GetUniqueChildPath` (`ClassIsland.Android/Storage/ClassIslandDocumentsProvider.cs:L447-L467`) 冲突\n- **修复:** 建议直接复用或扩展 `ClassIsland.Android/Storage/ClassIslandDocumentsProvider.cs` 中的 `GetUniqueChildPath`。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/StorageItemMaterializer.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 81
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 313,
                  "endLine": 331,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private static string GetUniquePath(string directory, string name)\n    {\n        var path = Path.Combine(directory, name);\n        if (!PortableNameExists(directory, name))\n        {\n            return path;\n        }\n\n        var stem = Path.GetFileNameWithoutExtension(name);\n        var extension = Path.GetExtension(name);\n        for (var index = 2; ; index++)\n        {\n            path = Path.Combine(directory, $\"{stem} ({index}){extension}\");\n            if (!PortableNameExists(directory, Path.GetFileName(path)))\n            {\n                return path;\n            }\n        }\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 313,
                  "endLine": 331,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +312,21 @@\n+\n+    private static string GetUniquePath(string directory, string name)\n+    {\n+        var path = Path.Combine(directory, name);\n+        if (!PortableNameExists(directory, name))\n+        {\n+            return path;\n+        }\n+\n+        var stem = Path.GetFileNameWithoutExtension(name);\n+        var extension = Path.GetExtension(name);\n+        for (var index = 2; ; index++)\n+        {\n+            path = Path.Combine(directory, $\"{stem} ({index}){extension}\");\n+            if (!PortableNameExists(directory, Path.GetFileName(path)))\n+            {\n+                return path;\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "GetUniquePath",
