            "markdown": "**提示** — `QueueRefreshDebounced` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosLessonsNotificationCoordinator.cs:L570-L587`) · **CPS `87.1%`** (C `88.2%`, P `86.1%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia.Threading`（`Dispatcher`）\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `UIKit`（`Dispatcher`）\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosLessonsNotificationCoordinator.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 116
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 570,
                  "endLine": 587,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void QueueRefreshDebounced()\n    {\n        if (!_isWorkStarted || _cancellation.IsCancellationRequested)\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        Dispatcher.UIThread.Post(() =>\n        {\n            if (!_isWorkStarted || _cancellation.IsCancellationRequested)\n            {\n                return;\n            }\n\n            _refreshDebounceTimer.Stop();\n            _refreshDebounceTimer.Start();\n        });\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 570,
                  "endLine": 587,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +569,20 @@\n+\n+    private void QueueRefreshDebounced()\n+    {\n+        if (!_isWorkStarted || _cancellation.IsCancellationRequested)\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        Dispatcher.UIThread.Post(() =>\n+        {\n+            if (!_isWorkStarted || _cancellation.IsCancellationRequested)\n+            {\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            _refreshDebounceTimer.Stop();\n+            _refreshDebounceTimer.Start();\n+        });\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
