            "markdown": "**提示** — `ci_hud_create_window` (`ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Bridge/ClassIslandHudBridge.swift:L579-L597`) · **CPS `87.2%`** (C `81.8%`, P `92.9%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 标识符 `ci_hud_create_window` (snake) 不符合 `camel` 命名规范\n- **修复:** 将 `ci_hud_create_window` 调整为 `camel` 命名格式。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Bridge/ClassIslandHudBridge.swift",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 92
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 579,
                  "endLine": 597,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@_cdecl(\"ci_hud_create_window\")\npublic func ci_hud_create_window(\n    _ frameX: Double,\n    _ frameY: Double,\n    _ width: Double,\n    _ height: Double\n) -> UnsafeMutableRawPointer? {\n    var result: UnsafeMutableRawPointer?\n    hudRunOnMainThread {\n        let window = ClassIslandHudPassthroughWindow(\n            frame: CGRect(x: frameX, y: frameY, width: width, height: height)\n        )\n        hudPrepareWindow(window)\n        hudCreatedWindow = window\n        result = Unmanaged<UIWindow>.passUnretained(window).toOpaque()\n        hudClearLastError()\n    }\n    return result\n}"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 579,
                  "endLine": 597,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +578,21 @@\n+/// 分配时就使用 HUD 窗口子类，UIKit 才会在窗口上屏时按系统窗口建立可托管的 CAContext。\n+@_cdecl(\"ci_hud_create_window\")\n+public func ci_hud_create_window(\n+    _ frameX: Double,\n+    _ frameY: Double,\n+    _ width: Double,\n+    _ height: Double\n+) -> UnsafeMutableRawPointer? {\n+    var result: UnsafeMutableRawPointer?\n+    hudRunOnMainThread {\n+        let window = ClassIslandHudPassthroughWindow(\n+            frame: CGRect(x: frameX, y: frameY, width: width, height: height)\n+        )\n+        hudPrepareWindow(window)\n+        hudCreatedWindow = window\n+        result = Unmanaged<UIWindow>.passUnretained(window).toOpaque()\n+        hudClearLastError()\n+    }\n+    return result\n+}\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
