            "markdown": "**提示** — `FindMostSeparatedUncoveredDayIndex` (`ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/IosLessonNotificationScheduleSelector.cs:L126-L161`) · **CPS `87.3%`** (C `85.4%`, P `89.3%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 11，32 行）\n- **修复:** 为 `FindMostSeparatedUncoveredDayIndex` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/IosLessonNotificationScheduleSelector.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 64
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 126,
                  "endLine": 161,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private static int FindMostSeparatedUncoveredDayIndex(\n        IReadOnlyList<IosLessonNotificationRequest[][]> days,\n        IReadOnlySet<int> selectedDayIndexes,\n        int remainingRequestCount)\n    {\n        var bestIndex = -1;\n        var bestDistance = -1;\n        for (var index = 0; index < days.Count; index++)\n        {\n            if (selectedDayIndexes.Contains(index))\n            {\n                continue;\n            }\n\n            var preferredGroup = days[index][FindPreferredGroupIndex(days[index])];\n            if (preferredGroup.Length > remainingRequestCount)\n            {\n                continue;\n            }\n"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 126,
                  "endLine": 161,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +125,38 @@\n+\n+    private static int FindMostSeparatedUncoveredDayIndex(\n+        IReadOnlyList<IosLessonNotificationRequest[][]> days,\n+        IReadOnlySet<int> selectedDayIndexes,\n+        int remainingRequestCount)\n+    {\n+        var bestIndex = -1;\n+        var bestDistance = -1;\n+        for (var index = 0; index < days.Count; index++)\n+        {\n+            if (selectedDayIndexes.Contains(index))\n+            {\n+                continue;\n+            }\n+\n+            var preferredGroup = days[index][FindPreferredGroupIndex(days[index])];\n+            if (preferredGroup.Length > remainingRequestCount)\n+            {\n+                continue;\n+            }\n+\n+            if (selectedDayIndexes.Count == 0)\n+            {\n+                return index;\n+            }\n+\n+            var distance = selectedDayIndexes.Min(selected => Math.Abs(selected - index));\n+            if (distance > bestDistance ||\n+                distance == bestDistance && index > bestIndex)\n+            {\n+                bestIndex = index;\n+                bestDistance = distance;\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        return bestIndex;\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "FindMostSeparatedUncoveredDayIndex",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/IosLessonNotificationScheduleSelector.cs::FindMostSeparatedUncoveredDayIndex",
                  "kind": "function"
                }
              ]
            }
