            "text": "[提示] EnsureInsideRoot — CPS=87.6% (C=84.7%, P=90.6%). 新增抛出异常（`InvalidDataException`），可能影响 1 个上游调用方 修复: 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `EnsureInsideRoot` (`ClassIsland/Services/SafeArchiveExtractor.cs:L111-L126`) · **CPS `87.6%`** (C `84.7%`, P `90.6%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 新增抛出异常（`InvalidDataException`），可能影响 1 个上游调用方\n- **修复:** 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Services/SafeArchiveExtractor.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 181
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 111,
                  "endLine": 126,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private static void EnsureInsideRoot(\n        string path,\n        string root,\n        string archivePath)\n    {\n        var relativePath = Path.GetRelativePath(root, path);\n        if (Path.IsPathRooted(relativePath) ||\n            relativePath == \"..\" ||\n            relativePath.StartsWith(\n                $\"..{Path.DirectorySeparatorChar}\",\n                StringComparison.Ordinal))\n        {\n            throw new InvalidDataException(\n                $\"归档包含越界路径：{archivePath}\");\n        }\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 111,
                  "endLine": 126,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +110,18 @@\n+\n+    private static void EnsureInsideRoot(\n+        string path,\n+        string root,\n+        string archivePath)\n+    {\n+        var relativePath = Path.GetRelativePath(root, path);\n+        if (Path.IsPathRooted(relativePath) ||\n+            relativePath == \"..\" ||\n+            relativePath.StartsWith(\n+                $\"..{Path.DirectorySeparatorChar}\",\n+                StringComparison.Ordinal))\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidDataException(\n+                $\"归档包含越界路径：{archivePath}\");\n+        }\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
