        {
          "ruleId": "CPS009",
          "ruleIndex": 8,
          "level": "note",
          "rank": 11.2,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] Arm — CPS=87.7% (C=86.8%, P=88.7%). 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 3，25 行） 创建了后台定时器（`Timer` / `setInterval`），需确认销毁竞态安全 修复: 为 `Arm` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。 在 `Dispose()` 中释放定时器，并防止销毁后回调继续执行。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `Arm` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/LiveActivities/IosLiveActivityService.cs:L312-L339`) · **CPS `87.7%`** (C `86.8%`, P `88.7%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 3，25 行）\n- **问题:** 创建了后台定时器（`Timer` / `setInterval`），需确认销毁竞态安全\n- **修复:** 为 `Arm` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。\n- **修复:** 在 `Dispose()` 中释放定时器，并防止销毁后回调继续执行。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/LiveActivities/IosLiveActivityService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 109
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 312,
                  "endLine": 339,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "public void Arm()\n        {\n            if (Volatile.Read(ref _state) != Pending)\n            {\n                return;\n            }\n\n            if (_cancellationToken.CanBeCanceled)\n            {\n                var registration = _cancellationToken.Register(\n                    static state => ((PendingOperation)state!).RequestCancellation(\n                        CallerCancellationRequested),\n                    this);\n                StoreCancellationRegistration(registration);\n            }\n\n            if (Volatile.Read(ref _state) != Pending)\n            {\n                return;\n            }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 312,
                  "endLine": 339,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +311,30 @@\n+\n+        public void Arm()\n+        {\n+            if (Volatile.Read(ref _state) != Pending)\n+            {\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            if (_cancellationToken.CanBeCanceled)\n+            {\n+                var registration = _cancellationToken.Register(\n+                    static state => ((PendingOperation)state!).RequestCancellation(\n+                        CallerCancellationRequested),\n+                    this);\n+                StoreCancellationRegistration(registration);\n+            }\n+\n+            if (Volatile.Read(ref _state) != Pending)\n+            {\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            var timeoutTimer = new Timer(\n+                static state => ((PendingOperation)state!).RequestCancellation(TimeoutRequested),\n+                this,\n+                NativeOperationTimeout,\n+                Timeout.InfiniteTimeSpan);\n+            StoreTimeoutTimer(timeoutTimer);\n+        }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
