            "markdown": "**提示** — `ci_hud_prepare_window` (`ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Bridge/ClassIslandHudBridge.swift:L557-L572`) · **CPS `87.8%`** (C `82.9%`, P `93.0%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 标识符 `ci_hud_prepare_window` (snake) 不符合 `camel` 命名规范\n- **修复:** 将 `ci_hud_prepare_window` 调整为 `camel` 命名格式。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Bridge/ClassIslandHudBridge.swift",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
