          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] TryStartHud — CPS=87.8% (C=86.4%, P=89.3%). 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 6，34 行） 修复: 为 `TryStartHud` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `TryStartHud` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudOverlayService.cs:L128-L164`) · **CPS `87.8%`** (C `86.4%`, P `89.3%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 6，34 行）\n- **修复:** 为 `TryStartHud` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudOverlayService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 122
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 128,
                  "endLine": 164,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private bool TryStartHud()\n    {\n        try\n        {\n            if (IosHudNativeBridge.IsRunning() == 1)\n            {\n                IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"正在终止旧悬浮主界面宿主\");\n                var stopResult = IosHudNativeBridge.Stop();\n                if (stopResult < 0 || IosHudNativeBridge.IsRunning() == 1)\n                {\n                    IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\n                        $\"无法重启悬浮主界面宿主：旧 HUD 无法终止，result={stopResult}，{IosHudNativeBridge.GetLastError()}\");\n                    return false;\n                }\n\n                IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"旧悬浮主界面宿主已终止\");\n            }\n\n            var dataDirectory = PrepareSnapshot();\n            IosStartupDiagnostics.Write($\"悬浮主界面数据快照：{dataDirectory}\");"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 128,
                  "endLine": 164,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +127,39 @@\n+\n+    private bool TryStartHud()\n+    {\n+        try\n+        {\n+            if (IosHudNativeBridge.IsRunning() == 1)\n+            {\n+                IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"正在终止旧悬浮主界面宿主\");\n+                var stopResult = IosHudNativeBridge.Stop();\n+                if (stopResult < 0 || IosHudNativeBridge.IsRunning() == 1)\n+                {\n+                    IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\n+                        $\"无法重启悬浮主界面宿主：旧 HUD 无法终止，result={stopResult}，{IosHudNativeBridge.GetLastError()}\");\n+                    return false;\n+                }\n+\n+                IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"旧悬浮主界面宿主已终止\");\n+            }\n+\n+            var dataDirectory = PrepareSnapshot();\n+            IosStartupDiagnostics.Write($\"悬浮主界面数据快照：{dataDirectory}\");\n+            var result = IosHudNativeBridge.Start(1, dataDirectory);\n+            if (result == 0)\n+            {\n+                IosStartupDiagnostics.Write($\"悬浮主界面宿主已启动：pid={IosHudNativeBridge.GetPid()}\");\n+                return true;\n+            }\n+\n+            IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\n+                $\"无法启动悬浮主界面宿主：result={result}，{IosHudNativeBridge.GetLastError()}\");\n+            return false;\n"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
