            "markdown": "**提示** — `ci_live_activity_get_availability` (`ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Bridge/ClassIslandLiveActivityBridge.swift:L654-L662`) · **CPS `87.9%`** (C `82.7%`, P `93.4%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 标识符 `ci_live_activity_get_availability` (snake) 不符合 `camel` 命名规范\n- **修复:** 将 `ci_live_activity_get_availability` 调整为 `camel` 命名格式。"
          },
