          "rank": 11.02,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] ci_live_activity_publish_json — CPS=87.9% (C=83.3%, P=92.6%). 标识符 `ci_live_activity_publish_json` (snake) 不符合 `camel` 命名规范 修复: 将 `ci_live_activity_publish_json` 调整为 `camel` 命名格式。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `ci_live_activity_publish_json` (`ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Bridge/ClassIslandLiveActivityBridge.swift:L664-L698`) · **CPS `87.9%`** (C `83.3%`, P `92.6%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 标识符 `ci_live_activity_publish_json` (snake) 不符合 `camel` 命名规范\n- **修复:** 将 `ci_live_activity_publish_json` 调整为 `camel` 命名格式。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Bridge/ClassIslandLiveActivityBridge.swift",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 93
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 664,
                  "endLine": 698,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@_cdecl(\"ci_live_activity_publish_json\")\npublic func ci_live_activity_publish_json(\n    _ jsonUTF8: UnsafePointer<CChar>?,\n    _ completion: ClassIslandLiveActivityCompletion?,\n    _ context: UnsafeMutableRawPointer?\n) {\n    guard #available(iOS 16.1, *) else {\n        complete(\n            .failure(.unsupported, message: \"Live Activities require iOS 16.1 or later.\"),\n            using: completion,\n            context: context\n        )\n        return\n    }\n\n    guard let jsonUTF8, let json = String(validatingUTF8: jsonUTF8) else {\n        ClassIslandLiveActivityCommandQueue.shared.report(\n            result: .failure(\n                .invalidContent,\n                message: \"json_utf8 must contain valid UTF-8 JSON.\""
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 664,
                  "endLine": 698,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +663,37 @@\n+\n+@_cdecl(\"ci_live_activity_publish_json\")\n+public func ci_live_activity_publish_json(\n+    _ jsonUTF8: UnsafePointer<CChar>?,\n+    _ completion: ClassIslandLiveActivityCompletion?,\n+    _ context: UnsafeMutableRawPointer?\n+) {\n+    guard #available(iOS 16.1, *) else {\n+        complete(\n+            .failure(.unsupported, message: \"Live Activities require iOS 16.1 or later.\"),\n+            using: completion,\n+            context: context\n+        )\n+        return\n+    }\n+\n+    guard let jsonUTF8, let json = String(validatingUTF8: jsonUTF8) else {\n+        ClassIslandLiveActivityCommandQueue.shared.report(\n+            result: .failure(\n+                .invalidContent,\n+                message: \"json_utf8 must contain valid UTF-8 JSON.\"\n+            ),\n+            completion: completion,\n+            context: context\n+        )\n+        return\n+    }\n+\n+    // 调用返回后托管层可以立即释放输入指针，因此必须先复制为 Swift Data。\n+    let jsonData = Data(json.utf8)\n+    ClassIslandLiveActivityCommandQueue.shared.publish(\n+        jsonData: jsonData,\n+        completion: completion,\n+        context: context\n+    )\n+}\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "ci_live_activity_publish_json",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Bridge/ClassIslandLiveActivityBridge.swift::ci_live_activity_publish_json",
                  "kind": "function"
                }
              ]
            }
