          "ruleId": "CPS002",
          "ruleIndex": 1,
          "level": "note",
          "rank": 10.93,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] ci_hud_stop_target — CPS=88.0% (C=83.0%, P=93.2%). 标识符 `ci_hud_stop_target` (snake) 不符合 `camel` 命名规范 修复: 将 `ci_hud_stop_target` 调整为 `camel` 命名格式。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `ci_hud_stop_target` (`ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Bridge/ClassIslandHudBridge.swift:L831-L842`) · **CPS `88.0%`** (C `83.0%`, P `93.2%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 标识符 `ci_hud_stop_target` (snake) 不符合 `camel` 命名规范\n- **修复:** 将 `ci_hud_stop_target` 调整为 `camel` 命名格式。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Bridge/ClassIslandHudBridge.swift",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 92
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 831,
                  "endLine": 842,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@_cdecl(\"ci_hud_stop_target\")\npublic func ci_hud_stop_target(_ pid: Int32) -> Int32 {\n    guard pid > 0, pid != getpid() else {\n        return HudError.invalidArgument.rawValue\n    }\n\n    if kill(pid_t(pid), SIGKILL) == 0 || errno == ESRCH {\n        return HudError.ok.rawValue\n    }\n\n    return HudError.terminationForbidden.rawValue\n}"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 831,
                  "endLine": 842,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +830,14 @@\n+\n+@_cdecl(\"ci_hud_stop_target\")\n+public func ci_hud_stop_target(_ pid: Int32) -> Int32 {\n+    guard pid > 0, pid != getpid() else {\n+        return HudError.invalidArgument.rawValue\n+    }\n+\n+    if kill(pid_t(pid), SIGKILL) == 0 || errno == ESRCH {\n+        return HudError.ok.rawValue\n+    }\n+\n+    return HudError.terminationForbidden.rawValue\n+}\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
