            "markdown": "**提示** — `GetText` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosNotificationQueueConsumer.cs:L353-L377`) · **CPS `88.0%`** (C `90.2%`, P `85.8%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层依赖：`services` 层引用了上层 `views/ui` 的 `ClassIsland.Core.Controls.NotificationTemplates`\n- **问题:** 跨层类型引用：`services` 层引用了 `views/ui` 层的 `RollingTextTemplate`（`ClassIsland.Core/Controls/NotificationTemplates/RollingTextTemplate.axaml.cs`）\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosNotificationQueueConsumer.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 119
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 353,
                  "endLine": 377,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private static string? GetText(NotificationContent? content)\n    {\n        if (content == null)\n        {\n            return null;\n        }\n\n        if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(content.SpeechContent))\n        {\n            return content.SpeechContent.Trim();\n        }\n\n        var text = content.Content switch\n        {\n            string value => value,\n            SimpleTextTemplateData value => value.Text,\n            TwoIconsMaskTemplateData value => value.Text,\n            RollingTextTemplate\n            {\n                DataContext: RollingTextTemplateData value"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 353,
                  "endLine": 377,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +352,27 @@\n+\n+    private static string? GetText(NotificationContent? content)\n+    {\n+        if (content == null)\n+        {\n+            return null;\n+        }\n+\n+        if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(content.SpeechContent))\n+        {\n+            return content.SpeechContent.Trim();\n+        }\n+\n+        var text = content.Content switch\n+        {\n+            string value => value,\n+            SimpleTextTemplateData value => value.Text,\n+            TwoIconsMaskTemplateData value => value.Text,\n+            RollingTextTemplate\n+            {\n+                DataContext: RollingTextTemplateData value\n+            } => value.Text,\n+            _ => null\n+        };\n+        return string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(text) ? null : text.Trim();\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
