          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] CopyDirectoryIfExists — CPS=88.0% (C=86.6%, P=89.4%). 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 7，28 行） 修复: 为 `CopyDirectoryIfExists` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `CopyDirectoryIfExists` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudOverlayService.cs:L251-L282`) · **CPS `88.0%`** (C `86.6%`, P `89.4%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 7，28 行）\n- **修复:** 为 `CopyDirectoryIfExists` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudOverlayService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 122
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 251,
                  "endLine": 282,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private static void CopyDirectoryIfExists(string source, string target)\n    {\n        if (!Directory.Exists(source))\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        foreach (var directory in Directory.EnumerateDirectories(source, \"*\", SearchOption.AllDirectories))\n        {\n            var relative = Path.GetRelativePath(source, directory);\n            if (IsExcludedSnapshotDirectory(relative))\n            {\n                continue;\n            }\n\n            Directory.CreateDirectory(Path.Combine(target, relative));\n        }\n\n        Directory.CreateDirectory(target);\n        foreach (var file in Directory.EnumerateFiles(source, \"*\", SearchOption.AllDirectories))"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 251,
                  "endLine": 282,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +250,34 @@\n+\n+    private static void CopyDirectoryIfExists(string source, string target)\n+    {\n+        if (!Directory.Exists(source))\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        foreach (var directory in Directory.EnumerateDirectories(source, \"*\", SearchOption.AllDirectories))\n+        {\n+            var relative = Path.GetRelativePath(source, directory);\n+            if (IsExcludedSnapshotDirectory(relative))\n+            {\n+                continue;\n+            }\n+\n+            Directory.CreateDirectory(Path.Combine(target, relative));\n+        }\n+\n+        Directory.CreateDirectory(target);\n+        foreach (var file in Directory.EnumerateFiles(source, \"*\", SearchOption.AllDirectories))\n+        {\n+            var relative = Path.GetRelativePath(source, file);\n+            if (IsExcludedSnapshotDirectory(relative))\n+            {\n+                continue;\n+            }\n+\n+            var destination = Path.Combine(target, relative);\n+            Directory.CreateDirectory(Path.GetDirectoryName(destination)!);\n+            File.Copy(file, destination, overwrite: true);\n+        }\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "CopyDirectoryIfExists",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudOverlayService.cs::CopyDirectoryIfExists",
                  "kind": "function"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
