          "level": "note",
          "rank": 10.83,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] DeleteOperationsOlderThan — CPS=88.1% (C=83.5%, P=92.9%). 裸 `catch` 或宽泛 `catch` 捕获了全部异常 修复: 改为捕获具体异常类型，避免吞掉非预期错误。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `DeleteOperationsOlderThan` (`ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/StorageItemMaterializer.cs:L146-L180`) · **CPS `88.1%`** (C `83.5%`, P `92.9%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 裸 `catch` 或宽泛 `catch` 捕获了全部异常\n- **修复:** 改为捕获具体异常类型，避免吞掉非预期错误。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/StorageItemMaterializer.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 81
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 146,
                  "endLine": 180,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "public int DeleteOperationsOlderThan(TimeSpan retention)\n    {\n        if (retention < TimeSpan.Zero)\n        {\n            throw new ArgumentOutOfRangeException(nameof(retention));\n        }\n\n        if (!Directory.Exists(_stagingRoot))\n        {\n            return 0;\n        }\n\n        var cutoff = DateTime.UtcNow - retention;\n        var deleted = 0;\n        foreach (var directory in Directory.EnumerateDirectories(_stagingRoot))\n        {\n            try\n            {\n                if ((File.GetAttributes(directory) & FileAttributes.ReparsePoint) != 0 ||\n                    Directory.GetLastWriteTimeUtc(directory) > cutoff)"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 146,
                  "endLine": 180,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +145,37 @@\n+    /// </summary>\n+    public int DeleteOperationsOlderThan(TimeSpan retention)\n+    {\n+        if (retention < TimeSpan.Zero)\n+        {\n+            throw new ArgumentOutOfRangeException(nameof(retention));\n+        }\n+\n+        if (!Directory.Exists(_stagingRoot))\n+        {\n+            return 0;\n+        }\n+\n+        var cutoff = DateTime.UtcNow - retention;\n+        var deleted = 0;\n+        foreach (var directory in Directory.EnumerateDirectories(_stagingRoot))\n+        {\n+            try\n+            {\n+                if ((File.GetAttributes(directory) & FileAttributes.ReparsePoint) != 0 ||\n+                    Directory.GetLastWriteTimeUtc(directory) > cutoff)\n+                {\n+                    continue;\n+                }\n+\n+                Directory.Delete(directory, true);\n+                deleted++;\n+            }\n+            catch\n+            {\n+                // 文件可能仍被正在进行的导入占用，留待下一次清理。\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        return deleted;\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "DeleteOperationsOlderThan",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/StorageItemMaterializer.cs::DeleteOperationsOlderThan",
                  "kind": "function"
                }
              ]
            }
