            "markdown": "**提示** — `DeleteEntry` (`ClassIsland/Services/FileSystemDataTransaction.cs:L157-L187`) · **CPS `88.1%`** (C `86.9%`, P `89.4%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 6，28 行）\n- **修复:** 为 `DeleteEntry` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Services/FileSystemDataTransaction.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 171
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 157,
                  "endLine": 187,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "internal static void DeleteEntry(string path)\n    {\n        if (!File.Exists(path) && !Directory.Exists(path))\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        var attributes = File.GetAttributes(path);\n        if ((attributes & FileAttributes.ReparsePoint) != 0)\n        {\n            if ((attributes & FileAttributes.Directory) != 0)\n            {\n                Directory.Delete(path, false);\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                File.Delete(path);\n            }\n\n            return;"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 157,
                  "endLine": 187,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +156,33 @@\n+\n+    internal static void DeleteEntry(string path)\n+    {\n+        if (!File.Exists(path) && !Directory.Exists(path))\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        var attributes = File.GetAttributes(path);\n+        if ((attributes & FileAttributes.ReparsePoint) != 0)\n+        {\n+            if ((attributes & FileAttributes.Directory) != 0)\n+            {\n+                Directory.Delete(path, false);\n+            }\n+            else\n+            {\n+                File.Delete(path);\n+            }\n+\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        if ((attributes & FileAttributes.Directory) != 0)\n+        {\n+            Directory.Delete(path, true);\n+        }\n+        else\n+        {\n+            File.Delete(path);\n+        }\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
