            "text": "[提示] NormalizeRelativePath — CPS=88.2% (C=88.9%, P=87.5%). 新增抛出异常（`InvalidDataException`），可能影响 8 个上游调用方 跨层类型引用：`domain/models` 层引用了 `views/ui` 层的 `Empty`（`ClassIsland.Core/Controls/Empty.axaml.cs`） 修复: 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `NormalizeRelativePath` (`ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/SafeArchivePath.cs:L42-L72`) · **CPS `88.2%`** (C `88.9%`, P `87.5%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 新增抛出异常（`InvalidDataException`），可能影响 8 个上游调用方\n- **问题:** 跨层类型引用：`domain/models` 层引用了 `views/ui` 层的 `Empty`（`ClassIsland.Core/Controls/Empty.axaml.cs`）\n- **修复:** 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/SafeArchivePath.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 77
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 42,
                  "endLine": 72,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "internal static string NormalizeRelativePath(string path)\n    {\n        ArgumentException.ThrowIfNullOrWhiteSpace(path);\n        if (path.IndexOf('\\0') >= 0)\n        {\n            throw new InvalidDataException(\"归档路径包含空字符。\");\n        }\n\n        var normalized = path.Replace('\\\\', '/');\n        if (normalized.StartsWith(\"/\", StringComparison.Ordinal) ||\n            IsWindowsAbsolutePath(normalized))\n        {\n            throw new InvalidDataException($\"归档包含绝对路径：{path}\");\n        }\n\n        var hasTrailingSeparator = normalized.EndsWith(\n            \"/\",\n            StringComparison.Ordinal);\n        var segments = normalized.Split('/', StringSplitOptions.None);\n        var segmentCount = hasTrailingSeparator"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 42,
                  "endLine": 72,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +41,33 @@\n+\n+    internal static string NormalizeRelativePath(string path)\n+    {\n+        ArgumentException.ThrowIfNullOrWhiteSpace(path);\n+        if (path.IndexOf('\\0') >= 0)\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidDataException(\"归档路径包含空字符。\");\n+        }\n+\n+        var normalized = path.Replace('\\\\', '/');\n+        if (normalized.StartsWith(\"/\", StringComparison.Ordinal) ||\n+            IsWindowsAbsolutePath(normalized))\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidDataException($\"归档包含绝对路径：{path}\");\n+        }\n+\n+        var hasTrailingSeparator = normalized.EndsWith(\n+            \"/\",\n+            StringComparison.Ordinal);\n+        var segments = normalized.Split('/', StringSplitOptions.None);\n+        var segmentCount = hasTrailingSeparator\n+            ? segments.Length - 1\n+            : segments.Length;\n+        if (segmentCount == 0 ||\n+            segments.Take(segmentCount).Any(IsUnsafeSegment))\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidDataException($\"归档包含无效相对路径：{path}\");\n+        }\n+\n+        return string.Join('/', segments.Take(segmentCount)) +\n+               (hasTrailingSeparator ? \"/\" : string.Empty);\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "NormalizeRelativePath",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/SafeArchivePath.cs::NormalizeRelativePath",
                  "kind": "function"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
