        {
          "ruleId": "CPS003",
          "ruleIndex": 2,
          "level": "note",
          "rank": 10.74,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] countdownValue — CPS=88.2% (C=89.0%, P=87.5%). 控制流嵌套过深（层级 4） 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 12，23 行） 修复: 扁平化多层条件分支。 为 `countdownValue` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `countdownValue` (`ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Extension/ClassIslandLiveActivityWidget.swift:L253-L275`) · **CPS `88.2%`** (C `89.0%`, P `87.5%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 控制流嵌套过深（层级 4）\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 12，23 行）\n- **修复:** 扁平化多层条件分支。\n- **修复:** 为 `countdownValue` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Extension/ClassIslandLiveActivityWidget.swift",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 97
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 253,
                  "endLine": 275,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@ViewBuilder\n    private func countdownValue(_ component: ClassIslandActivityComponent) -> some View {\n        if let targetTime = component.targetTime {\n            let targetDate = Date(timeIntervalSince1970: targetTime)\n            if targetDate > Date() {\n                Text(timerInterval: Date()...targetDate,\n                     countsDown: true, showsHours: true)\n                    .monospacedDigit().lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.65)\n                    .multilineTextAlignment(.leading)\n            } else {\n                Text(\"已到日期\")\n            }\n        } else if isStale {\n            Text(\"待更新\")\n        } else if let range = state.progressRange {\n            Text(timerInterval: range, countsDown: true, showsHours: false)\n                .monospacedDigit().lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.75)\n                .multilineTextAlignment(.leading)\n        } else {\n            Text(component.secondaryText.isEmpty ? \"暂无课程\" : component.secondaryText)"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 253,
                  "endLine": 275,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +252,25 @@\n+\n+    @ViewBuilder\n+    private func countdownValue(_ component: ClassIslandActivityComponent) -> some View {\n+        if let targetTime = component.targetTime {\n+            let targetDate = Date(timeIntervalSince1970: targetTime)\n+            if targetDate > Date() {\n+                Text(timerInterval: Date()...targetDate,\n+                     countsDown: true, showsHours: true)\n+                    .monospacedDigit().lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.65)\n+                    .multilineTextAlignment(.leading)\n+            } else {\n+                Text(\"已到日期\")\n+            }\n+        } else if isStale {\n+            Text(\"待更新\")\n+        } else if let range = state.progressRange {\n+            Text(timerInterval: range, countsDown: true, showsHours: false)\n+                .monospacedDigit().lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.75)\n+                .multilineTextAlignment(.leading)\n+        } else {\n+            Text(component.secondaryText.isEmpty ? \"暂无课程\" : component.secondaryText)\n+                .lineLimit(1)\n+        }\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "countdownValue",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Extension/ClassIslandLiveActivityWidget.swift::countdownValue",
                  "kind": "function"
                }
              ]
            }
