          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] ClassIslandSystemSnapshotError — CPS=88.3% (C=86.7%, P=90.0%). 较复杂的 Type 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 14，13 行） 修复: 为 `ClassIslandSystemSnapshotError` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `ClassIslandSystemSnapshotError` (`ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Shared/ClassIslandSystemSnapshot.swift:L98-L111`) · **CPS `88.3%`** (C `86.7%`, P `90.0%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Type 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 14，13 行）\n- **修复:** 为 `ClassIslandSystemSnapshotError` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Shared/ClassIslandSystemSnapshot.swift",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 101
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 98,
                  "endLine": 111,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "enum ClassIslandSystemSnapshotError: LocalizedError {\n    case sharedContainerUnavailable\n    case invalidSnapshot\n    case refreshRequired\n\n    var errorDescription: String? {\n        switch self {\n        case .sharedContainerUnavailable:\n            return \"无法读取课表：当前签名未启用共享数据（App Group），请检查侧载签名设置。\"\n        case .invalidSnapshot, .refreshRequired:\n            return \"课表需要更新，请打开 ClassIsland 后重试。\"\n        }\n    }\n}"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 98,
                  "endLine": 111,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +97,16 @@\n+\n+enum ClassIslandSystemSnapshotError: LocalizedError {\n+    case sharedContainerUnavailable\n+    case invalidSnapshot\n+    case refreshRequired\n+\n+    var errorDescription: String? {\n+        switch self {\n+        case .sharedContainerUnavailable:\n+            return \"无法读取课表：当前签名未启用共享数据（App Group），请检查侧载签名设置。\"\n+        case .invalidSnapshot, .refreshRequired:\n+            return \"课表需要更新，请打开 ClassIsland 后重试。\"\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
