          "rank": 10.65,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] ResetRequestTaskWhenCompletedAsync — CPS=88.3% (C=84.3%, P=92.4%). 裸 `catch` 或宽泛 `catch` 捕获了全部异常 修复: 改为捕获具体异常类型，避免吞掉非预期错误。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `ResetRequestTaskWhenCompletedAsync` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Platform/IosNotificationAuthorizationService.cs:L34-L54`) · **CPS `88.3%`** (C `84.3%`, P `92.4%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 裸 `catch` 或宽泛 `catch` 捕获了全部异常\n- **修复:** 改为捕获具体异常类型，避免吞掉非预期错误。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Platform/IosNotificationAuthorizationService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 133
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 34,
                  "endLine": 54,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private async Task ResetRequestTaskWhenCompletedAsync(Task<bool> requestTask)\n    {\n        try\n        {\n            await requestTask;\n        }\n        catch\n        {\n            // 原始任务由调用方观察；这里只负责在完成后允许下次重新检查授权状态。\n        }\n        finally\n        {\n            lock (_requestLock)\n            {\n                if (ReferenceEquals(_requestTask, requestTask))\n                {\n                    _requestTask = null;\n                }\n            }\n        }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 34,
                  "endLine": 54,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +33,23 @@\n+\n+    private async Task ResetRequestTaskWhenCompletedAsync(Task<bool> requestTask)\n+    {\n+        try\n+        {\n+            await requestTask;\n+        }\n+        catch\n+        {\n+            // 原始任务由调用方观察；这里只负责在完成后允许下次重新检查授权状态。\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            lock (_requestLock)\n+            {\n+                if (ReferenceEquals(_requestTask, requestTask))\n+                {\n+                    _requestTask = null;\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "ResetRequestTaskWhenCompletedAsync",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Platform/IosNotificationAuthorizationService.cs::ResetRequestTaskWhenCompletedAsync",
