            "markdown": "**提示** — `CompleteNotificationAsync` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosNotificationQueueConsumer.cs:L413-L422`) · **CPS `88.4%`** (C `90.4%`, P `86.5%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia.Threading`（`Dispatcher`）\n- **问题:** 跨层依赖：`services` 层引用了上层 `views/ui` 的 `ClassIsland.Core.Controls.NotificationTemplates` (`Dispatcher`)\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
