            "markdown": "**提示** — `FlushBeforeSuspension` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/SystemIntegration/IosSystemIntegrationCoordinator.cs:L70-L80`) · **CPS `88.4%`** (C `90.5%`, P `86.4%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia.Threading`（`Dispatcher, DispatcherPriority`）\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `UIKit`（`Dispatcher, DispatcherPriority`）\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/SystemIntegration/IosSystemIntegrationCoordinator.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 141
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 70,
                  "endLine": 80,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void FlushBeforeSuspension()\n    {\n        if (!Dispatcher.UIThread.CheckAccess())\n        {\n            Dispatcher.UIThread.Post(FlushBeforeSuspension, DispatcherPriority.Send);\n            return;\n        }\n        // 进入后台后不再等待防抖定时器，避免系统先挂起应用而留下旧快照。\n        _debounceTimer.Stop();\n        Refresh();\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 70,
                  "endLine": 80,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +69,13 @@\n+\n+    private void FlushBeforeSuspension()\n+    {\n+        if (!Dispatcher.UIThread.CheckAccess())\n+        {\n+            Dispatcher.UIThread.Post(FlushBeforeSuspension, DispatcherPriority.Send);\n+            return;\n+        }\n+        // 进入后台后不再等待防抖定时器，避免系统先挂起应用而留下旧快照。\n+        _debounceTimer.Stop();\n+        Refresh();\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "FlushBeforeSuspension",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/SystemIntegration/IosSystemIntegrationCoordinator.cs::FlushBeforeSuspension",
