            "markdown": "**提示** — `Resolve` (`ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/SafeChildDirectoryPath.cs:L25-L43`) · **CPS `88.5%`** (C `85.7%`, P `91.4%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 新增抛出异常（`InvalidDataException`），可能影响 19 个上游调用方\n- **修复:** 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/SafeChildDirectoryPath.cs",
