            "markdown": "**提示** — `ValidateForClassIslandDataExtraction` (`ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/ZipArchiveSafety.cs:L37-L57`) · **CPS `88.5%`** (C `85.7%`, P `91.3%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 新增抛出异常（`InvalidDataException`），可能影响 6 个上游调用方\n- **修复:** 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/ZipArchiveSafety.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 84
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 37,
                  "endLine": 57,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "public static void ValidateForClassIslandDataExtraction(ZipArchive archive)\n    {\n        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(archive);\n        var portablePaths = new HashSet<string>(StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase);\n        foreach (var entry in archive.Entries)\n        {\n            var portablePath = SafeArchivePath.NormalizeRelativePath(entry.FullName);\n            if (!portablePaths.Add(portablePath))\n            {\n                throw new InvalidDataException(\n                    $\"ClassIsland 数据归档包含跨平台重复路径：{entry.FullName}\");\n            }\n        }\n\n        ValidateForExtraction(\n            archive,\n            ClassIslandDataMaximumEntryCount,\n            ClassIslandDataMaximumEntryLength,\n            ClassIslandDataMaximumTotalLength,\n            DefaultMaximumCompressionRatio);"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 37,
                  "endLine": 57,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +36,23 @@\n+    /// </summary>\n+    public static void ValidateForClassIslandDataExtraction(ZipArchive archive)\n+    {\n+        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(archive);\n+        var portablePaths = new HashSet<string>(StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase);\n+        foreach (var entry in archive.Entries)\n+        {\n+            var portablePath = SafeArchivePath.NormalizeRelativePath(entry.FullName);\n+            if (!portablePaths.Add(portablePath))\n+            {\n+                throw new InvalidDataException(\n+                    $\"ClassIsland 数据归档包含跨平台重复路径：{entry.FullName}\");\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        ValidateForExtraction(\n+            archive,\n+            ClassIslandDataMaximumEntryCount,\n+            ClassIslandDataMaximumEntryLength,\n+            ClassIslandDataMaximumTotalLength,\n+            DefaultMaximumCompressionRatio);\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
