          "rank": 10.47,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] QueueLessonsRefresh — CPS=88.5% (C=90.9%, P=86.2%). 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia.Threading`（`Dispatcher`） 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `UIKit`（`Dispatcher`） 修复: 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `QueueLessonsRefresh` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/LiveActivities/LessonsLiveActivityCoordinator.cs:L246-L261`) · **CPS `88.5%`** (C `90.9%`, P `86.2%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia.Threading`（`Dispatcher`）\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `UIKit`（`Dispatcher`）\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/LiveActivities/LessonsLiveActivityCoordinator.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 110
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 246,
                  "endLine": 261,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void QueueLessonsRefresh()\n    {\n        if (Volatile.Read(ref _isStopping) != 0 ||\n            Interlocked.Exchange(ref _isLessonsRefreshDispatchQueued, 1) != 0)\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        // LessonsService 会依次更新状态、科目和时间段。延后一轮 UI 调度，\n        // 避免实时活动读取到半更新的课程快照。\n        Dispatcher.UIThread.Post(() =>\n        {\n            Interlocked.Exchange(ref _isLessonsRefreshDispatchQueued, 0);\n            QueueRefresh();\n        });\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 246,
                  "endLine": 261,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +245,18 @@\n+\n+    private void QueueLessonsRefresh()\n+    {\n+        if (Volatile.Read(ref _isStopping) != 0 ||\n+            Interlocked.Exchange(ref _isLessonsRefreshDispatchQueued, 1) != 0)\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        // LessonsService 会依次更新状态、科目和时间段。延后一轮 UI 调度，\n+        // 避免实时活动读取到半更新的课程快照。\n+        Dispatcher.UIThread.Post(() =>\n+        {\n+            Interlocked.Exchange(ref _isLessonsRefreshDispatchQueued, 0);\n+            QueueRefresh();\n+        });\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "QueueLessonsRefresh",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/LiveActivities/LessonsLiveActivityCoordinator.cs::QueueLessonsRefresh",
