          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] ResolveInsideRoot — CPS=88.6% (C=86.7%, P=90.5%). 新增抛出异常（`InvalidDataException`），可能影响 2 个上游调用方 修复: 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `ResolveInsideRoot` (`ClassIsland/Services/FileSystemDataTransaction.cs:L366-L381`) · **CPS `88.6%`** (C `86.7%`, P `90.5%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 新增抛出异常（`InvalidDataException`），可能影响 2 个上游调用方\n- **修复:** 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Services/FileSystemDataTransaction.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 171
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 366,
                  "endLine": 381,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private static string ResolveInsideRoot(string root, string relativePath)\n    {\n        var path = Path.GetFullPath(Path.Combine(root, relativePath));\n        var pathFromRoot = Path.GetRelativePath(root, path);\n        if (Path.IsPathRooted(pathFromRoot) ||\n            pathFromRoot == \"..\" ||\n            pathFromRoot.StartsWith(\n                $\"..{Path.DirectorySeparatorChar}\",\n                StringComparison.Ordinal))\n        {\n            throw new InvalidDataException($\"事务路径越界：{relativePath}\");\n        }\n\n        EnsureExistingPathComponentsAreNotLinks(path, root);\n        return path;\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 366,
                  "endLine": 381,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +365,18 @@\n+\n+    private static string ResolveInsideRoot(string root, string relativePath)\n+    {\n+        var path = Path.GetFullPath(Path.Combine(root, relativePath));\n+        var pathFromRoot = Path.GetRelativePath(root, path);\n+        if (Path.IsPathRooted(pathFromRoot) ||\n+            pathFromRoot == \"..\" ||\n+            pathFromRoot.StartsWith(\n+                $\"..{Path.DirectorySeparatorChar}\",\n+                StringComparison.Ordinal))\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidDataException($\"事务路径越界：{relativePath}\");\n+        }\n+\n+        EnsureExistingPathComponentsAreNotLinks(path, root);\n+        return path;\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
