            "markdown": "**提示** — `TryResolveSafeChildPath` (`ClassIsland/Services/PluginMarketService.cs:L325-L348`) · **CPS `88.6%`** (C `87.9%`, P `89.3%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层类型引用：`services` 层引用了 `views/ui` 层的 `Empty`（`ClassIsland.Core/Controls/Empty.axaml.cs`）\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Services/PluginMarketService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 179
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 325,
                  "endLine": 348,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private bool TryResolveSafeChildPath(\n        string rootPath,\n        string id,\n        string suffix,\n        string itemType,\n        out string targetPath)\n    {\n        try\n        {\n            SafeChildDirectoryPath.ValidateName(id);\n            targetPath = SafeChildDirectoryPath.Resolve(rootPath, $\"{id}{suffix}\");\n            return true;\n        }\n        catch (Exception exception) when (exception is ArgumentException or InvalidDataException)\n        {\n            Logger.LogWarning(\n                \"拒绝包含不安全 ID 的{ItemType}：{Id}；原因：{Reason}\",\n                itemType,\n                id,\n                exception.Message);"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 325,
                  "endLine": 348,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -294,1 +324,26 @@ public class PluginMarketService : ObservableRecipient, IPluginMarketService\n+\n+    private bool TryResolveSafeChildPath(\n+        string rootPath,\n+        string id,\n+        string suffix,\n+        string itemType,\n+        out string targetPath)\n+    {\n+        try\n+        {\n+            SafeChildDirectoryPath.ValidateName(id);\n+            targetPath = SafeChildDirectoryPath.Resolve(rootPath, $\"{id}{suffix}\");\n+            return true;\n+        }\n+        catch (Exception exception) when (exception is ArgumentException or InvalidDataException)\n+        {\n+            Logger.LogWarning(\n+                \"拒绝包含不安全 ID 的{ItemType}：{Id}；原因：{Reason}\",\n+                itemType,\n+                id,\n+                exception.Message);\n+            targetPath = string.Empty;\n+            return false;\n+        }\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "TryResolveSafeChildPath",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland/Services/PluginMarketService.cs::TryResolveSafeChildPath",
