          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] RecoverInterruptedPluginIndexInstalls — CPS=88.6% (C=88.1%, P=89.2%). 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 7，41 行） 修复: 为 `RecoverInterruptedPluginIndexInstalls` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `RecoverInterruptedPluginIndexInstalls` (`ClassIsland/Services/PluginMarketService.cs:L585-L627`) · **CPS `88.6%`** (C `88.1%`, P `89.2%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 7，41 行）\n- **修复:** 为 `RecoverInterruptedPluginIndexInstalls` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Services/PluginMarketService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 179
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 585,
                  "endLine": 627,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void RecoverInterruptedPluginIndexInstalls()\n    {\n        var rootPath = Services.PluginService.PluginsIndexPath;\n        if (!Directory.Exists(rootPath))\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        foreach (var backupPath in Directory.EnumerateDirectories(rootPath)\n                     .Where(x => Path.GetFileName(x).StartsWith(\n                         IndexBackupPrefix,\n                         StringComparison.Ordinal)))\n        {\n            var indexId = Path.GetFileName(backupPath)[IndexBackupPrefix.Length..];\n            try\n            {\n                var targetPath = SafeChildDirectoryPath.Resolve(rootPath, indexId);\n                if (Directory.Exists(targetPath))\n                {\n                    TryDeletePluginIndexDirectory(backupPath);"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 585,
                  "endLine": 627,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -400,1 +584,45 @@ public class PluginMarketService : ObservableRecipient, IPluginMarketService\n+\n+    private void RecoverInterruptedPluginIndexInstalls()\n+    {\n+        var rootPath = Services.PluginService.PluginsIndexPath;\n+        if (!Directory.Exists(rootPath))\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        foreach (var backupPath in Directory.EnumerateDirectories(rootPath)\n+                     .Where(x => Path.GetFileName(x).StartsWith(\n+                         IndexBackupPrefix,\n+                         StringComparison.Ordinal)))\n+        {\n+            var indexId = Path.GetFileName(backupPath)[IndexBackupPrefix.Length..];\n+            try\n+            {\n+                var targetPath = SafeChildDirectoryPath.Resolve(rootPath, indexId);\n+                if (Directory.Exists(targetPath))\n+                {\n+                    TryDeletePluginIndexDirectory(backupPath);\n+                }\n+                else\n+                {\n+                    Directory.Move(backupPath, targetPath);\n+                }\n+            }\n+            catch (Exception exception)\n+            {\n+                Logger.LogWarning(\n+                    exception,\n+              "
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
