                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "public void Start()\n        {\n            if (_completionSource.Task.IsCompleted)\n            {\n                return;\n            }\n\n            try\n            {\n                if (!CLLocationManager.LocationServicesEnabled)\n                {\n                    Fail(new InvalidOperationException(\"系统定位服务未开启，请在系统设置中开启定位服务后重试。\"));\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                _manager = new CLLocationManager\n                {\n                    Delegate = this\n                };\n"
