            "text": "[提示] ci_pip_enqueue_bgra — CPS=88.8% (C=84.7%, P=93.0%). 标识符 `ci_pip_enqueue_bgra` (snake) 不符合 `camel` 命名规范 修复: 将 `ci_pip_enqueue_bgra` 调整为 `camel` 命名格式。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `ci_pip_enqueue_bgra` (`ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Bridge/ClassIslandPipBridge.swift:L425-L441`) · **CPS `88.8%`** (C `84.7%`, P `93.0%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 标识符 `ci_pip_enqueue_bgra` (snake) 不符合 `camel` 命名规范\n- **修复:** 将 `ci_pip_enqueue_bgra` 调整为 `camel` 命名格式。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS.Native/Bridge/ClassIslandPipBridge.swift",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 94
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 425,
                  "endLine": 441,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@_cdecl(\"ci_pip_enqueue_bgra\")\npublic func ci_pip_enqueue_bgra(\n    _ pixels: UnsafeRawPointer?,\n    _ width: Int32,\n    _ height: Int32,\n    _ stride: Int32\n) -> Int32 {\n    let (controller, error) = pipController(\"ci_pip_enqueue_bgra\")\n    guard let controller else {\n        return error.rawValue\n    }\n    guard let pixels else {\n        pipSetLastError(\"ci_pip_enqueue_bgra: pixels 不能为 NULL。\")\n        return PipError.invalidArgument.rawValue\n    }\n    return controller.enqueue(pixels, width: Int(width), height: Int(height), stride: Int(stride)).rawValue\n}"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 425,
                  "endLine": 441,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +424,19 @@\n+\n+@_cdecl(\"ci_pip_enqueue_bgra\")\n+public func ci_pip_enqueue_bgra(\n+    _ pixels: UnsafeRawPointer?,\n+    _ width: Int32,\n+    _ height: Int32,\n+    _ stride: Int32\n+) -> Int32 {\n+    let (controller, error) = pipController(\"ci_pip_enqueue_bgra\")\n+    guard let controller else {\n+        return error.rawValue\n+    }\n+    guard let pixels else {\n+        pipSetLastError(\"ci_pip_enqueue_bgra: pixels 不能为 NULL。\")\n+        return PipError.invalidArgument.rawValue\n+    }\n+    return controller.enqueue(pixels, width: Int(width), height: Int(height), stride: Int(stride)).rawValue\n+}\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
