        {
          "ruleId": "CPS007",
          "ruleIndex": 6,
          "level": "note",
          "rank": 10.2,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] Start — CPS=88.8% (C=93.2%, P=84.6%). 跨异步回调读写未同步标志位 `_isStarted`，存在并发竞态 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia.Threading`（`Dispatcher`） 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `UIKit`（`Dispatcher`） 修复: 使用原子操作（`Interlocked` / `Atomic`）或互斥锁保护 `_isStarted`。 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `Start` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/LiveActivities/LessonsLiveActivityCoordinator.cs:L61-L91`) · **CPS `88.8%`** (C `93.2%`, P `84.6%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨异步回调读写未同步标志位 `_isStarted`，存在并发竞态\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `Avalonia.Threading`（`Dispatcher`）\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `UIKit`（`Dispatcher`）\n- **修复:** 使用原子操作（`Interlocked` / `Atomic`）或互斥锁保护 `_isStarted`。\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/LiveActivities/LessonsLiveActivityCoordinator.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 110
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 61,
                  "endLine": 91,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "public void Start()\n    {\n        if (_isStarted)\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        _isStarted = true;\n        AppBase.Current.AppStarted += OnAppStarted;\n        _foregroundObserver = NSNotificationCenter.DefaultCenter.AddObserver(\n            UIApplication.WillEnterForegroundNotification,\n            _ =>\n            {\n                Dispatcher.UIThread.Post(() =>\n                {\n                    _lastRequestedContent = null;\n                    _retryAfter = default;\n                    _activityStateKnown = false;\n                    _isAvailabilityUnavailable = false;\n                    QueueRefresh();"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 61,
                  "endLine": 91,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +60,33 @@\n+\n+    public void Start()\n+    {\n+        if (_isStarted)\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        _isStarted = true;\n+        AppBase.Current.AppStarted += OnAppStarted;\n+        _foregroundObserver = NSNotificationCenter.DefaultCenter.AddObserver(\n+            UIApplication.WillEnterForegroundNotification,\n+            _ =>\n+            {\n+                Dispatcher.UIThread.Post(() =>\n+                {\n+                    _lastRequestedContent = null;\n+                    _retryAfter = default;\n+                    _activityStateKnown = false;\n+                    _isAvailabilityUnavailable = false;\n+                    QueueRefresh();\n+                });\n+            });\n+        _backgroundObserver = NSNotificationCenter.DefaultCenter.AddObserver(\n+            UIApplication.WillResignActiveNotification,\n+            _ => Dispatcher.UIThread.Post(QueueRefresh));\n+\n+        if (AppBase.CurrentLifetime == ApplicationLifetime.Running)\n+        {\n+            StartWork();\n+        }\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "Start",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/LiveActivities/LessonsLiveActivityCoordinator.cs::Start",
                  "kind": "function"
