        {
          "ruleId": "CPS003",
          "ruleIndex": 2,
          "level": "note",
          "rank": 10.2,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] ScheduleNextRefresh — CPS=88.8% (C=89.6%, P=88.0%). 复杂度较高（15 > 基线 P90 14，圈复杂度 14） 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 15，48 行） 修复: 使用提前返回减少条件嵌套。 为 `ScheduleNextRefresh` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `ScheduleNextRefresh` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/LiveActivities/LessonsLiveActivityCoordinator.cs:L421-L475`) · **CPS `88.8%`** (C `89.6%`, P `88.0%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 复杂度较高（15 > 基线 P90 14，圈复杂度 14）\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 15，48 行）\n- **修复:** 使用提前返回减少条件嵌套。\n- **修复:** 为 `ScheduleNextRefresh` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/LiveActivities/LessonsLiveActivityCoordinator.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 110
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 421,
                  "endLine": 475,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void ScheduleNextRefresh(\n        LessonLiveActivityContent? content,\n        DateTimeOffset? publicationTime)\n    {\n        if (!_isWorkStarted ||\n            _cancellation.IsCancellationRequested ||\n            Volatile.Read(ref _isPublicationPaused) != 0 ||\n            Volatile.Read(ref _isStopping) != 0 ||\n            _isAvailabilityUnavailable)\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        var now = DateTimeOffset.UtcNow;\n        var nextRefresh = now + MaximumRefreshInterval;\n\n        void Consider(DateTimeOffset candidate)\n        {\n            var normalized = candidate.ToUniversalTime();\n            if (normalized > now && normalized < nextRefresh)"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 421,
                  "endLine": 475,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +420,57 @@\n+\n+    private void ScheduleNextRefresh(\n+        LessonLiveActivityContent? content,\n+        DateTimeOffset? publicationTime)\n+    {\n+        if (!_isWorkStarted ||\n+            _cancellation.IsCancellationRequested ||\n+            Volatile.Read(ref _isPublicationPaused) != 0 ||\n+            Volatile.Read(ref _isStopping) != 0 ||\n+            _isAvailabilityUnavailable)\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        var now = DateTimeOffset.UtcNow;\n+        var nextRefresh = now + MaximumRefreshInterval;\n+\n+        void Consider(DateTimeOffset candidate)\n+        {\n+            var normalized = candidate.ToUniversalTime();\n+            if (normalized > now && normalized < nextRefresh)\n+            {\n+                nextRefresh = normalized;\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        if (_retryAfter > now)\n+        {\n+            Consider(_retryAfter);\n+        }\n+\n+        if (content != null)\n+        {\n+            if (content.IsUpcomingLesson &&\n+                publicationTime is { } scheduledTime)\n+            {\n+                Consider(scheduledTime + BoundaryRefreshLeeway);\n+            }"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
