            "markdown": "**提示** — `RequestAuthorizationIfNeededAsync` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Platform/IosNotificationAuthorizationService.cs:L18-L32`) · **CPS `88.8%`** (C `85.4%`, P `92.3%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 未跟踪异步调用 `_ = ResetRequestTaskWhenCompletedAsync(...)` 的任务状态与异常\n- **修复:** 保存 `Task` 引用以便退出时等待，并确保 `ResetRequestTaskWhenCompletedAsync` 内部捕获异常。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Platform/IosNotificationAuthorizationService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
