          "ruleIndex": 8,
          "level": "note",
          "rank": 10.02,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] QueueNavigation — CPS=89.0% (C=89.6%, P=88.4%). 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 7，15 行） 调度的异步匿名函数 `Post(async () => ...)` 等效于 `async void` 修复: 为 `QueueNavigation` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。 在回调内部补充 `try/catch` 或改用返回 `Task` 的 `InvokeAsync`。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `QueueNavigation` (`ClassIsland.iOS/AppDelegate.cs:L459-L473`) · **CPS `89.0%`** (C `89.6%`, P `88.4%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 7，15 行）\n- **问题:** 调度的异步匿名函数 `Post(async () => ...)` 等效于 `async void`\n- **修复:** 为 `QueueNavigation` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。\n- **修复:** 在回调内部补充 `try/catch` 或改用返回 `Task` 的 `InvokeAsync`。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/AppDelegate.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 104
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 459,
                  "endLine": 473,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void QueueNavigation(Uri uri)\n    {\n        Dispatcher.UIThread.Post(async () =>\n        {\n            if (uri.AbsolutePath.StartsWith(\"/system/\", StringComparison.Ordinal))\n            {\n                if (_systemNavigationService != null) await _systemNavigationService.NavigateAsync(uri);\n                return;\n            }\n            if (IAppHost.TryGetService<IUriNavigationService>() is { } navigationService)\n            {\n                navigationService.NavigateWrapped(uri);\n            }\n        });\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 459,
                  "endLine": 473,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +458,17 @@\n+\n+    private void QueueNavigation(Uri uri)\n+    {\n+        Dispatcher.UIThread.Post(async () =>\n+        {\n+            if (uri.AbsolutePath.StartsWith(\"/system/\", StringComparison.Ordinal))\n+            {\n+                if (_systemNavigationService != null) await _systemNavigationService.NavigateAsync(uri);\n+                return;\n+            }\n+            if (IAppHost.TryGetService<IUriNavigationService>() is { } navigationService)\n+            {\n+                navigationService.NavigateWrapped(uri);\n+            }\n+        });\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
