            "markdown": "**提示** — `TrimText` (`ClassIsland/Services/LiveActivities/LiveActivityComponentSnapshotFactory.cs:L149-L154`) · **CPS `89.0%`** (C `87.2%`, P `90.9%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层类型引用：`services` 层引用了 `views/ui` 层的 `Empty`（`ClassIsland.Core/Controls/Empty.axaml.cs`）\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
