            "markdown": "**提示** — `ValidateJsonFile` (`ClassIsland/Services/StagedDataImportValidator.cs:L112-L144`) · **CPS `89.1%`** (C `88.2%`, P `90.1%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 新增抛出异常（`InvalidDataException`），可能影响 2 个上游调用方\n- **修复:** 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Services/StagedDataImportValidator.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 183
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 112,
                  "endLine": 144,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private static void ValidateJsonFile(\n        string path,\n        JsonValueKind? expectedRootKind)\n    {\n        ArgumentException.ThrowIfNullOrWhiteSpace(path);\n\n        try\n        {\n            using var input = new FileStream(\n                path,\n                FileMode.Open,\n                FileAccess.Read,\n                FileShare.Read);\n            using var document = JsonDocument.Parse(input);\n            if (expectedRootKind is { } expected &&\n                document.RootElement.ValueKind != expected)\n            {\n                throw new InvalidDataException(\n                    $\"JSON 配置根节点类型无效，期望 {expected}：{path}\");\n            }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 112,
                  "endLine": 144,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +111,35 @@\n+\n+    private static void ValidateJsonFile(\n+        string path,\n+        JsonValueKind? expectedRootKind)\n+    {\n+        ArgumentException.ThrowIfNullOrWhiteSpace(path);\n+\n+        try\n+        {\n+            using var input = new FileStream(\n+                path,\n+                FileMode.Open,\n+                FileAccess.Read,\n+                FileShare.Read);\n+            using var document = JsonDocument.Parse(input);\n+            if (expectedRootKind is { } expected &&\n+                document.RootElement.ValueKind != expected)\n+            {\n+                throw new InvalidDataException(\n+                    $\"JSON 配置根节点类型无效，期望 {expected}：{path}\");\n+            }\n+        }\n+        catch (InvalidDataException)\n+        {\n+            throw;\n+        }\n+        catch (Exception exception) when (\n+            exception is JsonException or IOException)\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidDataException(\n+                $\"无法读取 JSON 配置：{path}\",\n+                exception);\n+        }\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "ValidateJsonFile",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland/Services/StagedDataImportValidator.cs::ValidateJsonFile",
