        {
          "ruleId": "CPS009",
          "ruleIndex": 8,
          "level": "note",
          "rank": 9.65,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] GetControlledComponents — CPS=89.4% (C=88.1%, P=90.8%). 新增抛出异常（`InvalidDataException`），可能影响 4 个上游调用方 修复: 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `GetControlledComponents` (`ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/TrustedFileSystemPathPolicy.cs:L8-L49`) · **CPS `89.4%`** (C `88.1%`, P `90.8%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 新增抛出异常（`InvalidDataException`），可能影响 4 个上游调用方\n- **修复:** 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/TrustedFileSystemPathPolicy.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 83
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 8,
                  "endLine": 49,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "internal static IReadOnlyList<string> GetControlledComponents(\n        string path,\n        string trustedRoot)\n    {\n        ArgumentException.ThrowIfNullOrWhiteSpace(path);\n        ArgumentException.ThrowIfNullOrWhiteSpace(trustedRoot);\n\n        var fullPath = Path.TrimEndingDirectorySeparator(Path.GetFullPath(path));\n        var fullRoot = Path.TrimEndingDirectorySeparator(\n            Path.GetFullPath(trustedRoot));\n        var relativePath = Path.GetRelativePath(fullRoot, fullPath);\n        if (Path.IsPathRooted(relativePath) ||\n            relativePath == \"..\" ||\n            relativePath.StartsWith(\n                $\"..{Path.DirectorySeparatorChar}\",\n                StringComparison.Ordinal) ||\n            Path.AltDirectorySeparatorChar != Path.DirectorySeparatorChar &&\n            relativePath.StartsWith(\n                $\"..{Path.AltDirectorySeparatorChar}\",\n                StringComparison.Ordinal))"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 8,
                  "endLine": 49,
                  "snippet": {
