            "markdown": "**提示** — `IsSameOrDescendant` (`ClassIsland/Views/SettingPages/StorageSettingsPage.axaml.cs:L350-L362`) · **CPS `89.4%`** (C `88.2%`, P `90.7%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 疑似重复实现：`IsSameOrDescendant` 与上游 `IsSameOrDescendant` (`ClassIsland.Android/Services/Platform/LauncherService.cs:L70-L79`) 相似度 91.1%\n- **问题:** 重复函数签名：`private static bool IsSameOrDescendant(string path, string root)` 与上游 `IsSameOrDescendant` (`ClassIsland.Android/Services/Platform/LauncherService.cs:L70-L79`) 冲突\n- **修复:** 建议直接复用或扩展 `ClassIsland.Android/Services/Platform/LauncherService.cs` 中的 `IsSameOrDescendant`。"
