          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] RunBackgroundRefreshAsync — CPS=89.5% (C=89.6%, P=89.5%). 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 3，26 行） 修复: 为 `RunBackgroundRefreshAsync` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `RunBackgroundRefreshAsync` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosLessonsNotificationCoordinator.cs:L336-L363`) · **CPS `89.5%`** (C `89.6%`, P `89.5%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 3，26 行）\n- **修复:** 为 `RunBackgroundRefreshAsync` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosLessonsNotificationCoordinator.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 116
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 336,
                  "endLine": 363,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private async Task RunBackgroundRefreshAsync(BackgroundTaskLease lease)\n    {\n        try\n        {\n            using var linkedCancellation = CancellationTokenSource.CreateLinkedTokenSource(\n                _cancellation.Token,\n                lease.ExpirationToken);\n            await RefreshInBackgroundAsync(linkedCancellation.Token);\n        }\n        catch (OperationCanceledException)\n        {\n            // 应用已终止刷新，或系统收回后台执行时间。\n        }\n        catch (IosNotificationSynchronizationDeferredException exception)\n        {\n            // 保持上一份原生排程；回到前台时会强制复核并完成全量换表。\n            Console.WriteLine(exception.Message);\n        }\n        catch (Exception exception)\n        {"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 336,
                  "endLine": 363,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +335,30 @@\n+\n+    private async Task RunBackgroundRefreshAsync(BackgroundTaskLease lease)\n+    {\n+        try\n+        {\n+            using var linkedCancellation = CancellationTokenSource.CreateLinkedTokenSource(\n+                _cancellation.Token,\n+                lease.ExpirationToken);\n+            await RefreshInBackgroundAsync(linkedCancellation.Token);\n+        }\n+        catch (OperationCanceledException)\n+        {\n+            // 应用已终止刷新，或系统收回后台执行时间。\n+        }\n+        catch (IosNotificationSynchronizationDeferredException exception)\n+        {\n+            // 保持上一份原生排程；回到前台时会强制复核并完成全量换表。\n+            Console.WriteLine(exception.Message);\n+        }\n+        catch (Exception exception)\n+        {\n+            Console.Error.WriteLine($\"iOS/iPadOS 退后台前同步课程通知时发生异常：{exception}\");\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            lease.Dispose();\n+            Interlocked.Exchange(ref _backgroundRefreshActive, 0);\n+        }\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
