          "rank": 9.56,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] GetInboxDirectory — CPS=89.5% (C=89.4%, P=89.7%). 跨层类型引用：`services` 层引用了 `views/ui` 层的 `Empty`（`ClassIsland.Core/Controls/Empty.axaml.cs`） 修复: 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `GetInboxDirectory` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudPreviewNotificationPoller.cs:L64-L77`) · **CPS `89.5%`** (C `89.4%`, P `89.7%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层类型引用：`services` 层引用了 `views/ui` 层的 `Empty`（`ClassIsland.Core/Controls/Empty.axaml.cs`）\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudPreviewNotificationPoller.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 123
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 64,
                  "endLine": 77,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private static string GetInboxDirectory()\n    {\n        var hudDataDirectory = Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(\"CLASSISLAND_HUD_DATA_DIR\");\n        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(hudDataDirectory))\n        {\n            return string.Empty;\n        }\n\n        // CLASSISLAND_HUD_DATA_DIR 指向 .../HudData/Snapshot-xxx，收件箱与快照目录同级。\n        var hudRoot = Path.GetDirectoryName(Path.GetFullPath(hudDataDirectory));\n        return string.IsNullOrEmpty(hudRoot)\n            ? string.Empty\n            : Path.Combine(hudRoot, HudPreviewNotificationForwarder.PreviewInboxFolderName);\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 64,
                  "endLine": 77,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +63,16 @@\n+\n+    private static string GetInboxDirectory()\n+    {\n+        var hudDataDirectory = Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(\"CLASSISLAND_HUD_DATA_DIR\");\n+        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(hudDataDirectory))\n+        {\n+            return string.Empty;\n+        }\n+\n+        // CLASSISLAND_HUD_DATA_DIR 指向 .../HudData/Snapshot-xxx，收件箱与快照目录同级。\n+        var hudRoot = Path.GetDirectoryName(Path.GetFullPath(hudDataDirectory));\n+        return string.IsNullOrEmpty(hudRoot)\n+            ? string.Empty\n+            : Path.Combine(hudRoot, HudPreviewNotificationForwarder.PreviewInboxFolderName);\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "GetInboxDirectory",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudPreviewNotificationPoller.cs::GetInboxDirectory",
