            "markdown": "**提示** — `LaunchPath` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Platform/IosLauncherService.cs:L25-L36`) · **CPS `89.5%`** (C `87.2%`, P `91.8%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 疑似重复实现：`LaunchPath` 与上游 `LaunchPath` (`ClassIsland.Desktop/Services/Platform/LauncherService.cs:L11-L30`) 相似度 83.6%\n- **问题:** 重复函数签名：`public Task LaunchPath(string path)` 与上游 `LaunchPath` (`ClassIsland.Android/Services/Platform/LauncherService.cs:L14-L62`) 冲突\n- **修复:** 建议直接复用或扩展 `ClassIsland.Desktop/Services/Platform/LauncherService.cs` 中的 `LaunchPath`。"
