          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] CreateNextClassText — CPS=89.6% (C=89.7%, P=89.5%). 跨层类型引用：`services` 层引用了 `views/ui` 层的 `Empty`（`ClassIsland.Core/Controls/Empty.axaml.cs`） 修复: 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `CreateNextClassText` (`ClassIsland/Services/LiveActivities/LessonsLiveActivitySnapshotFactory.cs:L256-L274`) · **CPS `89.6%`** (C `89.7%`, P `89.5%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层类型引用：`services` 层引用了 `views/ui` 层的 `Empty`（`ClassIsland.Core/Controls/Empty.axaml.cs`）\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Services/LiveActivities/LessonsLiveActivitySnapshotFactory.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 174
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 256,
                  "endLine": 274,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private string CreateNextClassText(bool includeStartTime)\n    {\n        var nextItem = LessonsService.NextClassTimeLayoutItem;\n        if (ReferenceEquals(nextItem, TimeLayoutItem.Empty) ||\n            nextItem.EndTime <= nextItem.StartTime)\n        {\n            return string.Empty;\n        }\n\n        var name = GetSubjectName(LessonsService.NextClassSubject, string.Empty);\n        if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(name))\n        {\n            return string.Empty;\n        }\n\n        return includeStartTime\n            ? $\"下一节：{name} {FormatTime(nextItem.StartTime)}\"\n            : $\"下一节：{name}\";\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 256,
                  "endLine": 274,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +255,21 @@\n+\n+    private string CreateNextClassText(bool includeStartTime)\n+    {\n+        var nextItem = LessonsService.NextClassTimeLayoutItem;\n+        if (ReferenceEquals(nextItem, TimeLayoutItem.Empty) ||\n+            nextItem.EndTime <= nextItem.StartTime)\n+        {\n+            return string.Empty;\n+        }\n+\n+        var name = GetSubjectName(LessonsService.NextClassSubject, string.Empty);\n+        if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(name))\n+        {\n+            return string.Empty;\n+        }\n+\n+        return includeStartTime\n+            ? $\"下一节：{name} {FormatTime(nextItem.StartTime)}\"\n+            : $\"下一节：{name}\";\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
