            "markdown": "**提示** — `LaunchUrl` (`ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Stubs/Services/ShellLauncherService.cs:L46-L60`) · **CPS `89.7%`** (C `87.9%`, P `91.6%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 疑似重复实现：`LaunchUrl` 与上游 `LaunchUrl` (`ClassIsland.Desktop/Services/Platform/LauncherService.cs:L32-L39`) 相似度 84.4%\n- **问题:** 重复函数签名：`public Task LaunchUrl(string url)` 与上游 `LaunchUrl` (`ClassIsland.Android/Services/Platform/LauncherService.cs:L64-L68`) 冲突\n- **修复:** 建议直接复用或扩展 `ClassIsland.Desktop/Services/Platform/LauncherService.cs` 中的 `LaunchUrl`。"
