            "markdown": "**提示** — `GetDeltaString` (`ClassIsland/Services/LiveActivities/LessonsLiveActivitySnapshotFactory.cs:L60-L70`) · **CPS `89.7%`** (C `87.9%`, P `91.6%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 疑似重复实现：`GetDeltaString` 与上游 `Convert` (`ClassIsland.Core/Converters/SecondsToFormatTimeConverter.cs:L31-L56`) 相似度 77.0%\n- **修复:** 建议直接复用或扩展 `ClassIsland.Core/Converters/SecondsToFormatTimeConverter.cs` 中的 `Convert`。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Services/LiveActivities/LessonsLiveActivitySnapshotFactory.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 174
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 60,
                  "endLine": 70,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private static string GetDeltaString(DateTime now, TimeSpan target)\n    {\n        var v = target - now.TimeOfDay;\n        return v.TotalSeconds switch // 显示秒数\n        {\n            >= 3600 => $\"{Math.Floor(v.TotalHours)}:{v.Minutes:00}:{v.Seconds:00}\",\n            >= 60 => $\"{v.Minutes}:{v.Seconds:00}\",\n            >= 0 => $\"{v.Seconds}s\",\n            _ => \"\"\n        };\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 60,
                  "endLine": 70,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +59,13 @@\n+\n+    private static string GetDeltaString(DateTime now, TimeSpan target)\n+    {\n+        var v = target - now.TimeOfDay;\n+        return v.TotalSeconds switch // 显示秒数\n+        {\n+            >= 3600 => $\"{Math.Floor(v.TotalHours)}:{v.Minutes:00}:{v.Seconds:00}\",\n+            >= 60 => $\"{v.Minutes}:{v.Seconds:00}\",\n+            >= 0 => $\"{v.Seconds}s\",\n+            _ => \"\"\n+        };\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
