          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] NormalizeFileSystemRelativePath — CPS=89.8% (C=88.0%, P=91.7%). 新增抛出异常（`InvalidDataException`），可能影响 4 个上游调用方 修复: 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `NormalizeFileSystemRelativePath` (`ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/SafeArchivePath.cs:L74-L85`) · **CPS `89.8%`** (C `88.0%`, P `91.7%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 新增抛出异常（`InvalidDataException`），可能影响 4 个上游调用方\n- **修复:** 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/SafeArchivePath.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 77
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 74,
                  "endLine": 85,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "internal static string NormalizeFileSystemRelativePath(string path)\n    {\n        ArgumentException.ThrowIfNullOrWhiteSpace(path);\n        if (Path.DirectorySeparatorChar != '\\\\' && path.Contains('\\\\'))\n        {\n            throw new InvalidDataException(\n                $\"文件名包含无法跨平台安全归档的反斜杠：{path}\");\n        }\n\n        return NormalizeRelativePath(\n            path.Replace(Path.DirectorySeparatorChar, '/'));\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 74,
                  "endLine": 85,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +73,14 @@\n+\n+    internal static string NormalizeFileSystemRelativePath(string path)\n+    {\n+        ArgumentException.ThrowIfNullOrWhiteSpace(path);\n+        if (Path.DirectorySeparatorChar != '\\\\' && path.Contains('\\\\'))\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidDataException(\n+                $\"文件名包含无法跨平台安全归档的反斜杠：{path}\");\n+        }\n+\n+        return NormalizeRelativePath(\n+            path.Replace(Path.DirectorySeparatorChar, '/'));\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
