            "markdown": "**提示** — `ProcessNotificationAsync` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosNotificationQueueConsumer.cs:L168-L210`) · **CPS `90.0%`** (C `90.8%`, P `89.2%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 6，39 行）\n- **修复:** 为 `ProcessNotificationAsync` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosNotificationQueueConsumer.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 119
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 168,
                  "endLine": 210,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private async Task ProcessNotificationAsync(\n        QueuedNotification notification,\n        CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n    {\n        try\n        {\n            if (!HasActiveTicket(notification))\n            {\n                return;\n            }\n\n            var authorized = await _authorizationService\n                .RequestAuthorizationIfNeededAsync()\n                .WaitAsync(cancellationToken);\n            cancellationToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();\n            if (!HasActiveTicket(notification))\n            {\n                return;\n            }\n"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 168,
                  "endLine": 210,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +167,45 @@\n+\n+    private async Task ProcessNotificationAsync(\n+        QueuedNotification notification,\n+        CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n+    {\n+        try\n+        {\n+            if (!HasActiveTicket(notification))\n+            {\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            var authorized = await _authorizationService\n+                .RequestAuthorizationIfNeededAsync()\n+                .WaitAsync(cancellationToken);\n+            cancellationToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();\n+            if (!HasActiveTicket(notification))\n+            {\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            if (!authorized)\n+            {\n+                Console.Error.WriteLine(\"iOS/iPadOS 通知权限未授予，无法显示即时提醒。\");\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            await SubmitImmediateNotificationAsync(notification, cancellationToken);\n+        }\n+        catch (OperationCanceledException)\n+            when (cancellationToken.IsCancellationRequested ||\n+                  !HasActiveTicket(notification))\n+        {\n+            // 消费者停止或提醒链已取消，不再投递过期通知。\n+        }\n+        catch (Exception exception)\n+        {\n+            Console.Error.WriteLine($\"提交 iOS 即时通"
                  }
                }
              },
