            "markdown": "**提示** — `ProcessInbox` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudPreviewNotificationPoller.cs:L79-L117`) · **CPS `90.1%`** (C `91.1%`, P `89.2%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 8，36 行）\n- **修复:** 为 `ProcessInbox` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudPreviewNotificationPoller.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 123
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 79,
                  "endLine": 117,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void ProcessInbox()\n    {\n        if (_isProcessing || _isDisposed)\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        _isProcessing = true;\n        try\n        {\n            var inboxDirectory = GetInboxDirectory();\n            if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(inboxDirectory) || !Directory.Exists(inboxDirectory))\n            {\n                return;\n            }\n\n            foreach (var path in Directory.EnumerateFiles(inboxDirectory, \"*.json\").OrderBy(x => x))\n            {\n                var request = ReadRequest(path);\n                TryDelete(path);"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 79,
                  "endLine": 117,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +78,41 @@\n+\n+    private void ProcessInbox()\n+    {\n+        if (_isProcessing || _isDisposed)\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        _isProcessing = true;\n+        try\n+        {\n+            var inboxDirectory = GetInboxDirectory();\n+            if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(inboxDirectory) || !Directory.Exists(inboxDirectory))\n+            {\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            foreach (var path in Directory.EnumerateFiles(inboxDirectory, \"*.json\").OrderBy(x => x))\n+            {\n+                var request = ReadRequest(path);\n+                TryDelete(path);\n+                if (request is null ||\n+                    request.Kind != ShowNotificationKind ||\n+                    DateTimeOffset.Now - request.CreatedAt > MaximumRequestAge)\n+                {\n+                    continue;\n+                }\n+\n+                ShowPreviewNotification(request.Settings);\n+            }\n+        }\n+        catch (Exception exception)\n+        {\n+            IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"读取悬浮岛提醒预览收件箱失败\", exception);\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            _isProcessing = false;"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "ProcessInbox",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudPreviewNotificationPoller.cs::ProcessInbox",
