          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] StartHudWindowRegistration — CPS=90.3% (C=88.2%, P=92.5%). 事件 `_hudWindowRegistrationTimer.Tick +=` 绑定了匿名函数，后续无法解绑（`-=`） 修复: 改用具名方法并在销毁时执行 `-=` 解绑。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `StartHudWindowRegistration` (`ClassIsland.iOS/AppDelegate.cs:L376-L386`) · **CPS `90.3%`** (C `88.2%`, P `92.5%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 事件 `_hudWindowRegistrationTimer.Tick +=` 绑定了匿名函数，后续无法解绑（`-=`）\n- **修复:** 改用具名方法并在销毁时执行 `-=` 解绑。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/AppDelegate.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 104
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 376,
                  "endLine": 386,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void StartHudWindowRegistration()\n    {\n        _hudWindowRegistrationAttempts = 0;\n        _hudWindowRegistrationTimer = new DispatcherTimer\n        {\n            Interval = TimeSpan.FromMilliseconds(100)\n        };\n        _hudWindowRegistrationTimer.Tick += (_, _) => TryRegisterHudWindow();\n        _hudWindowRegistrationTimer.Start();\n        TryRegisterHudWindow();\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 376,
                  "endLine": 386,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +375,13 @@\n+\n+    private void StartHudWindowRegistration()\n+    {\n+        _hudWindowRegistrationAttempts = 0;\n+        _hudWindowRegistrationTimer = new DispatcherTimer\n+        {\n+            Interval = TimeSpan.FromMilliseconds(100)\n+        };\n+        _hudWindowRegistrationTimer.Tick += (_, _) => TryRegisterHudWindow();\n+        _hudWindowRegistrationTimer.Start();\n+        TryRegisterHudWindow();\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
