            "markdown": "**提示** — `IosAccentPickerService` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Platform/IosAccentPickerService.cs:L19-L24`) · **CPS `90.4%`** (C `88.1%`, P `92.7%`, 权重 `0.0%`)\n- **问题:** 事件 `_session.PropertyChanged +=` 绑定了匿名函数，后续无法解绑（`-=`）\n- **修复:** 改用具名方法并在销毁时执行 `-=` 解绑。"
