            "markdown": "**提示** — `ShowToastAsync` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosDesktopToastService.cs:L30-L66`) · **CPS `90.5%`** (C `91.6%`, P `89.5%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层类型引用：`services` 层引用了 `views/ui` 层的 `Empty`（`ClassIsland.Core/Controls/Empty.axaml.cs`）\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosDesktopToastService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 113
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 30,
                  "endLine": 66,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "public async Task ShowToastAsync(DesktopToastContent content)\n    {\n        var center = UNUserNotificationCenter.Current;\n        var settings = await center.GetNotificationSettingsAsync();\n        // 与 Android 一致：只在已获授权时发送，不为应用消息主动弹出授权请求。\n        if (settings.AuthorizationStatus is not\n            (UNAuthorizationStatus.Authorized or UNAuthorizationStatus.Provisional))\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        var buttons = content.Buttons.Take(MaximumButtonCount).ToList();\n        var categoryIdentifier = await EnsureCategoryAsync(buttons.Select(x => x.Key).ToList());\n        var notificationId = Guid.NewGuid();\n        TrackCallbacks(notificationId, new ToastCallbacks(\n            () => content.Activated?.Invoke(this, EventArgs.Empty),\n            buttons.Select(x => x.Value).ToList()));\n\n        using var notificationContent = new UNMutableNotificationContent();\n        notificationContent.Title = content.Title;"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 30,
                  "endLine": 66,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +29,39 @@\n+\n+    public async Task ShowToastAsync(DesktopToastContent content)\n+    {\n+        var center = UNUserNotificationCenter.Current;\n+        var settings = await center.GetNotificationSettingsAsync();\n+        // 与 Android 一致：只在已获授权时发送，不为应用消息主动弹出授权请求。\n+        if (settings.AuthorizationStatus is not\n+            (UNAuthorizationStatus.Authorized or UNAuthorizationStatus.Provisional))\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        var buttons = content.Buttons.Take(MaximumButtonCount).ToList();\n+        var categoryIdentifier = await EnsureCategoryAsync(buttons.Select(x => x.Key).ToList());\n+        var notificationId = Guid.NewGuid();\n+        TrackCallbacks(notificationId, new ToastCallbacks(\n+            () => content.Activated?.Invoke(this, EventArgs.Empty),\n+            buttons.Select(x => x.Value).ToList()));\n+\n+        using var notificationContent = new UNMutableNotificationContent();\n+        notificationContent.Title = content.Title;\n+        notificationContent.Body = content.Body;\n+        notificationContent.Sound = UNNotificationSound.Default;\n+        notificationContent.CategoryIdentifier = categoryIdentifier;\n+        using var request = UNN"
                  }
                }
              },
