          "level": "note",
          "rank": 8.56,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] StartWork — CPS=90.6% (C=92.9%, P=88.4%). 创建了后台定时器（`Timer` / `setInterval`），需确认销毁竞态安全 跨层类型引用：`services` 层引用了 `views/ui` 层的 `SystemEventsService`（`platforms/ClassIsland.Platforms.Windows/Services/SystemEventsService.cs`） 修复: 在 `Dispose()` 中释放定时器，并防止销毁后回调继续执行。 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `StartWork` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/LiveActivities/LessonsLiveActivityCoordinator.cs:L95-L125`) · **CPS `90.6%`** (C `92.9%`, P `88.4%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 创建了后台定时器（`Timer` / `setInterval`），需确认销毁竞态安全\n- **问题:** 跨层类型引用：`services` 层引用了 `views/ui` 层的 `SystemEventsService`（`platforms/ClassIsland.Platforms.Windows/Services/SystemEventsService.cs`）\n- **修复:** 在 `Dispose()` 中释放定时器，并防止销毁后回调继续执行。\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/LiveActivities/LessonsLiveActivityCoordinator.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 110
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 95,
                  "endLine": 125,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void StartWork()\n    {\n        if (_isWorkStarted || Volatile.Read(ref _isStopping) != 0)\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        _lessonsService = IAppHost.GetService<ILessonsService>();\n        _settingsService = IAppHost.GetService<SettingsService>();\n        _logger = IAppHost.TryGetService<ILogger<LessonsLiveActivityCoordinator>>();\n        var exactTimeService = IAppHost.GetService<IExactTimeService>();\n        _exactTimeService = exactTimeService;\n        _weatherService = IAppHost.GetService<IWeatherService>();\n        _snapshotFactory = new LessonsLiveActivitySnapshotFactory(\n            _lessonsService,\n            exactTimeService);\n        _lessonsService.CurrentTimeStateChanged += OnLessonsStateChanged;\n        _lessonsService.PropertyChanged += OnLessonsPropertyChanged;\n        ObserveClasses();\n        _settingsService.PropertyChanged += OnSettingsServicePropertyChanged;"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 95,
                  "endLine": 125,
                  "snippet": {
