            "markdown": "**提示** — `ProcessLessons` (`ClassIsland/Services/LessonsService.cs:L867-L1017`) · **CPS `90.9%`** (C `91.5%`, P `90.4%`, 权重 `0.0%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层类型引用：`services` 层引用了 `views/ui` 层的 `Empty`（`ClassIsland.Core/Controls/Empty.axaml.cs`）\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
