            "markdown": "**提示** — `WillConnect` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/SystemIntegration/IosSystemSceneDelegate.cs:L25-L32`) · **CPS `91.0%`** (C `92.1%`, P `89.9%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 跨层耦合：`services` 层直接使用了 UI 框架 `UIKit`（`Window`）\n- **修复:** 通过下层接口抽象隔离对上层模块的直接依赖。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/SystemIntegration/IosSystemSceneDelegate.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 143
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 25,
                  "endLine": 32,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "[Export(\"scene:willConnectToSession:options:\")]\n    public void WillConnect(UIScene scene, UISceneSession session, UISceneConnectionOptions options)\n    {\n        _avaloniaDelegate.WillConnect(scene, session, options);\n        Window = _avaloniaDelegate.GetWindow();\n        if (UIApplication.SharedApplication.Delegate is not AppDelegate appDelegate) return;\n        foreach (var activity in options.UserActivities) appDelegate.HandleSystemActivity(activity);\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 25,
                  "endLine": 32,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +24,10 @@\n+\n+    [Export(\"scene:willConnectToSession:options:\")]\n+    public void WillConnect(UIScene scene, UISceneSession session, UISceneConnectionOptions options)\n+    {\n+        _avaloniaDelegate.WillConnect(scene, session, options);\n+        Window = _avaloniaDelegate.GetWindow();\n+        if (UIApplication.SharedApplication.Delegate is not AppDelegate appDelegate) return;\n+        foreach (var activity in options.UserActivities) appDelegate.HandleSystemActivity(activity);\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
