          "rank": 8.19,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] StartNavigationProgressAnimation — CPS=91.0% (C=91.4%, P=90.7%). 疑似重复实现：`StartNavigationProgressAnimation` 与上游 `StartNavigationProgressAnimation` (`ClassIsland.Android/Controls/UI/AndroidViewHost.axaml.cs:L749-L773`) 相似度 100.0% 修复: 建议直接复用或扩展 `ClassIsland.Android/Controls/UI/AndroidViewHost.axaml.cs` 中的 `StartNavigationProgressAnimation`。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `StartNavigationProgressAnimation` (`ClassIsland/Controls/UI/MobileViewHost.axaml.cs:L775-L799`) · **CPS `91.0%`** (C `91.4%`, P `90.7%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 疑似重复实现：`StartNavigationProgressAnimation` 与上游 `StartNavigationProgressAnimation` (`ClassIsland.Android/Controls/UI/AndroidViewHost.axaml.cs:L749-L773`) 相似度 100.0%\n- **修复:** 建议直接复用或扩展 `ClassIsland.Android/Controls/UI/AndroidViewHost.axaml.cs` 中的 `StartNavigationProgressAnimation`。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Controls/UI/MobileViewHost.axaml.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 152
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 775,
                  "endLine": 799,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private int StartNavigationProgressAnimation()\n    {\n        var animationVersion = ++_navigationProgressAnimationVersion;\n        var visual = ElementComposition.GetElementVisual(NavigationProgressBarFill);\n        if (visual == null)\n        {\n            return animationVersion;\n        }\n\n        var compositor = visual.Compositor;\n        var progressAnimation = compositor.CreateVector3DKeyFrameAnimation();\n        progressAnimation.InsertKeyFrame(0.0f, visual.Scale with { X = 0.05 });\n        progressAnimation.InsertKeyFrame(0.35f, visual.Scale with { X = 0.65 }, new CubicEaseOut());\n        progressAnimation.InsertKeyFrame(1.0f, visual.Scale with { X = 0.9 }, new CubicEaseOut());\n        progressAnimation.Duration = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(1.5);\n        visual.StartAnimation(nameof(visual.Scale), progressAnimation);\n\n        var opacityAnimation = compositor.CreateScalarKeyFrameAnimation();\n        opacityAnimation.InsertKeyFrame(0.0f, 1);\n        opacityAnimation.InsertKeyFrame(1.0f, 1);"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 775,
                  "endLine": 799,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +774,27 @@\n+\n+    private int StartNavigationProgressAnimation()\n+    {\n+        var animationVersion = ++_navigationProgressAnimationVersion;\n+        var visual = ElementComposition.GetElementVisual(NavigationProgressBarFill);\n+        if (visual == null)\n+        {\n+            return animationVersion;\n+        }\n+\n+        var compositor = visual.Compositor;\n+        var progressAnimation = compositor.CreateVector3DKeyFrameAnimation();\n+        progressAnimation.InsertKeyFrame(0.0f, visual.Scale with { X = 0.05 });\n+        progressAnimation.InsertKeyFrame(0.35f, visual.Scale with { X = 0.65 }, new CubicEaseOut());\n+        progressAnimation.InsertKeyFrame(1.0f, visual.Scale with { X = 0.9 }, new CubicEaseOut());\n+        progressAnimation.Duration = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(1.5);\n+        visual.StartAnimation(nameof(visual.Scale), progressAnimation);\n+\n+        var opacityAnimation = compositor.CreateScalarKeyFrameAnimation();\n+        opacityAnimation.InsertKeyFrame(0.0f, 1);\n+        opacityAnimation.InsertKeyFrame(1.0f, 1);\n+        opacityAnimation.Duration = progressAnimation.Duration;\n+        visual.StartAnimation(nameof(visual.Opacity), opacityAnimation);\n+\n+     "
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "StartNavigationProgressAnimation",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland/Controls/UI/MobileViewHost.axaml.cs::StartNavigationProgressAnimation",
