            "markdown": "**提示** — `TryDeleteDirectory` (`ClassIsland/Services/FileSystemDataTransaction.cs:L189-L212`) · **CPS `91.1%`** (C `89.9%`, P `92.3%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 裸 `catch` 或宽泛 `catch` 捕获了全部异常\n- **修复:** 改为捕获具体异常类型，避免吞掉非预期错误。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Services/FileSystemDataTransaction.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 171
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 189,
                  "endLine": 212,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "internal static void TryDeleteDirectory(string? path)\n    {\n        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(path))\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        try\n        {\n            if (!Directory.Exists(path))\n            {\n                return;\n            }\n\n            var attributes = File.GetAttributes(path);\n            Directory.Delete(\n                path,\n                (attributes & FileAttributes.ReparsePoint) == 0);\n        }\n        catch"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 189,
                  "endLine": 212,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +188,26 @@\n+\n+    internal static void TryDeleteDirectory(string? path)\n+    {\n+        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(path))\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        try\n+        {\n+            if (!Directory.Exists(path))\n+            {\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            var attributes = File.GetAttributes(path);\n+            Directory.Delete(\n+                path,\n+                (attributes & FileAttributes.ReparsePoint) == 0);\n+        }\n+        catch\n+        {\n+            // 临时目录清理失败不能掩盖操作结果。\n+        }\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
