            "text": "[提示] TryForward — CPS=91.1% (C=90.2%, P=92.0%). `.NET ILogger` 日志模板使用了空占位符 `{}` 修复: 改用具名占位符（如 `{Uri}`、`{Note}`）。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `TryForward` (`ClassIsland/Services/Overlay/HudPreviewNotificationForwarder.cs:L42-L68`) · **CPS `91.1%`** (C `90.2%`, P `92.0%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** `.NET ILogger` 日志模板使用了空占位符 `{}`\n- **修复:** 改用具名占位符（如 `{Uri}`、`{Note}`）。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Services/Overlay/HudPreviewNotificationForwarder.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 178
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 42,
                  "endLine": 68,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "public static bool TryForward(NotificationActionSettings settings)\n    {\n        var overlayService = PlatformServices.MainWindowOverlayService;\n        if (!overlayService.IsSupported || !overlayService.IsEnabled || !overlayService.IsRenderedOutOfProcess)\n        {\n            return false;\n        }\n\n        try\n        {\n            Directory.CreateDirectory(InboxDirectory);\n            CleanupStaleRequests();\n            var request = new HudPreviewNotification\n            {\n                Settings = settings\n            };\n            var path = Path.Combine(InboxDirectory, $\"{Guid.NewGuid():N}.json\");\n            File.WriteAllText(path, JsonSerializer.Serialize(request, SerializerOptions));\n            Logger?.LogInformation(\"已将提醒预览转发到悬浮主界面收件箱：{}\", path);\n            return true;"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 42,
                  "endLine": 68,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +41,29 @@\n+    /// </summary>\n+    public static bool TryForward(NotificationActionSettings settings)\n+    {\n+        var overlayService = PlatformServices.MainWindowOverlayService;\n+        if (!overlayService.IsSupported || !overlayService.IsEnabled || !overlayService.IsRenderedOutOfProcess)\n+        {\n+            return false;\n+        }\n+\n+        try\n+        {\n+            Directory.CreateDirectory(InboxDirectory);\n+            CleanupStaleRequests();\n+            var request = new HudPreviewNotification\n+            {\n+                Settings = settings\n+            };\n+            var path = Path.Combine(InboxDirectory, $\"{Guid.NewGuid():N}.json\");\n+            File.WriteAllText(path, JsonSerializer.Serialize(request, SerializerOptions));\n+            Logger?.LogInformation(\"已将提醒预览转发到悬浮主界面收件箱：{}\", path);\n+            return true;\n+        }\n+        catch (Exception exception)\n+        {\n+            Logger?.LogError(exception, \"无法把提醒预览转发到悬浮主界面，已回退到本地显示\");\n+            return false;\n+        }\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
