          "rank": 8.01,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] SetupHudHost — CPS=91.2% (C=90.2%, P=92.2%). 调度的异步匿名函数 `Post(async () => ...)` 等效于 `async void` 修复: 在回调内部补充 `try/catch` 或改用返回 `Task` 的 `InvokeAsync`。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `SetupHudHost` (`ClassIsland.iOS/AppDelegate.cs:L232-L249`) · **CPS `91.2%`** (C `90.2%`, P `92.2%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 调度的异步匿名函数 `Post(async () => ...)` 等效于 `async void`\n- **修复:** 在回调内部补充 `try/catch` 或改用返回 `Task` 的 `InvokeAsync`。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/AppDelegate.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 104
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 232,
                  "endLine": 249,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void SetupHudHost(App app, ISingleViewApplicationLifetime lifetime)\n    {\n        IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"HUD mode: creating overlay host\");\n        _hudHost = new IosHudHost();\n        // 共享代码在 HUD 模式不会导航页面，仅需要一个可用的宿主提供方以满足初始化路径。\n        IViewHostProvider.Instance = new IosViewHostProvider(new MobileViewHost());\n        lifetime.MainView = _hudHost;\n        // 参考实现都在 didFinishLaunching 阶段创建并上屏 HUD 窗口；这里同步执行，\n        // 保证窗口类、secure 标记与上屏发生在同一启动相位。\n        EnsureHudWindow(lifetime);\n        Dispatcher.UIThread.Post(async () =>\n        {\n            EnsureHudWindow(lifetime);\n            app.PhonyRootWindow = await GetTopLevelAsync(_hudHost);\n            IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"HUD host ready; starting App.Init\");\n            app.Init();\n        });\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 232,
                  "endLine": 249,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +231,20 @@\n+\n+    private void SetupHudHost(App app, ISingleViewApplicationLifetime lifetime)\n+    {\n+        IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"HUD mode: creating overlay host\");\n+        _hudHost = new IosHudHost();\n+        // 共享代码在 HUD 模式不会导航页面，仅需要一个可用的宿主提供方以满足初始化路径。\n+        IViewHostProvider.Instance = new IosViewHostProvider(new MobileViewHost());\n+        lifetime.MainView = _hudHost;\n+        // 参考实现都在 didFinishLaunching 阶段创建并上屏 HUD 窗口；这里同步执行，\n+        // 保证窗口类、secure 标记与上屏发生在同一启动相位。\n+        EnsureHudWindow(lifetime);\n+        Dispatcher.UIThread.Post(async () =>\n+        {\n+            EnsureHudWindow(lifetime);\n+            app.PhonyRootWindow = await GetTopLevelAsync(_hudHost);\n+            IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"HUD host ready; starting App.Init\");\n+            app.Init();\n+        });\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
