          "rank": 8.01,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] SetEnabled — CPS=91.2% (C=93.2%, P=89.2%). 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 12，39 行） 修复: 为 `SetEnabled` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `SetEnabled` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosPipOverlayService.cs:L110-L156`) · **CPS `91.2%`** (C `93.2%`, P `89.2%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 较复杂的 Block 逻辑缺少直接单元测试（复杂度 12，39 行）\n- **修复:** 为 `SetEnabled` 的关键分支与边界条件补充单元测试。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosPipOverlayService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 125
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 110,
                  "endLine": 156,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void SetEnabled(bool value, bool persist)\n    {\n        if (value == _isEnabled)\n        {\n            if (persist)\n            {\n                PersistSetting(value);\n            }\n\n            return;\n        }\n\n        if (value)\n        {\n            if (!IsSupported || !TryStartRendering())\n            {\n                // 启动失败时通知 UI 回到未启用状态，避免开关显示为已开启但画中画不可用。\n                PropertyChanged?.Invoke(this, new PropertyChangedEventArgs(nameof(IsEnabled)));\n                return;\n            }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 110,
                  "endLine": 156,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +109,49 @@\n+\n+    private void SetEnabled(bool value, bool persist)\n+    {\n+        if (value == _isEnabled)\n+        {\n+            if (persist)\n+            {\n+                PersistSetting(value);\n+            }\n+\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        if (value)\n+        {\n+            if (!IsSupported || !TryStartRendering())\n+            {\n+                // 启动失败时通知 UI 回到未启用状态，避免开关显示为已开启但画中画不可用。\n+                PropertyChanged?.Invoke(this, new PropertyChangedEventArgs(nameof(IsEnabled)));\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            _isEnabled = true;\n+            Logger?.LogInformation(\"画中画悬浮主界面已启用（{Source}）\", persist ? \"用户打开开关\" : \"启动时恢复\");\n+            // 用户亲手打开开关时立即弹出画中画，作为开关生效的反馈。\n+            // 启动时恢复不属于用户操作，系统不允许直接开启，改为在用户第一次点击应用时开启。\n+            if (persist)\n+            {\n+                StartFromUserAction();\n+            }\n+            else\n+            {\n+                _isFirstTapStartPending = true;\n+            }\n+        }\n+        else\n+        {\n+            _isEnabled = false;"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "SetEnabled",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosPipOverlayService.cs::SetEnabled",
                  "kind": "function"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
