          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] AnimatePageContentOffsetAsync — CPS=91.2% (C=92.6%, P=89.8%). 函数长度（71 行）超过 C# P90 基线（50 行） 修复: 将 `AnimatePageContentOffsetAsync` 拆分为更小的子函数（建议 < 50 行）。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `AnimatePageContentOffsetAsync` (`ClassIsland/Controls/UI/MobileViewHost.axaml.cs:L392-L468`) · **CPS `91.2%`** (C `92.6%`, P `89.8%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 函数长度（71 行）超过 C# P90 基线（50 行）\n- **修复:** 将 `AnimatePageContentOffsetAsync` 拆分为更小的子函数（建议 < 50 行）。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Controls/UI/MobileViewHost.axaml.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 152
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 392,
                  "endLine": 468,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private async Task AnimatePageContentOffsetAsync(\n        double targetOffset,\n        TimeSpan duration,\n        IEasing easing)\n    {\n        if (PageContentRoot.RenderTransform is not TranslateTransform transform)\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        var startOffset = transform.Y;\n        CancelInputPaneAnimation();\n\n        if (duration <= TimeSpan.Zero || Math.Abs(startOffset - targetOffset) < 0.01)\n        {\n            transform.Y = targetOffset;\n            return;\n        }\n\n        var cancellation = new CancellationTokenSource();"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 392,
                  "endLine": 468,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +391,79 @@\n+\n+    private async Task AnimatePageContentOffsetAsync(\n+        double targetOffset,\n+        TimeSpan duration,\n+        IEasing easing)\n+    {\n+        if (PageContentRoot.RenderTransform is not TranslateTransform transform)\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        var startOffset = transform.Y;\n+        CancelInputPaneAnimation();\n+\n+        if (duration <= TimeSpan.Zero || Math.Abs(startOffset - targetOffset) < 0.01)\n+        {\n+            transform.Y = targetOffset;\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        var cancellation = new CancellationTokenSource();\n+        _inputPaneAnimationCancellation = cancellation;\n+        var animation = new Animation\n+        {\n+            Duration = duration,\n+            Easing = new InputPaneAnimationEasing(easing),\n+            FillMode = FillMode.Forward,\n+            Children =\n+            {\n+                new KeyFrame\n+                {\n+                    Cue = new Cue(0),\n+                    Setters =\n+                    {\n+                        new Setter(TranslateTransform.YProperty, startOffset)\n+                    }\n+                },\n+                new KeyFrame"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
