        {
          "ruleId": "CPS009",
          "ruleIndex": 8,
          "level": "note",
          "rank": 7.92,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] DidReceiveNotificationResponse — CPS=91.3% (C=92.3%, P=90.3%). `async void DidReceiveNotificationResponse(...)` 无法被等待，未捕获异常会直接导致进程崩溃 修复: 非事件处理方法请改为返回 `async Task`。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `DidReceiveNotificationResponse` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosNotificationCenterDelegate.cs:L35-L64`) · **CPS `91.3%`** (C `92.3%`, P `90.3%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** `async void DidReceiveNotificationResponse(...)` 无法被等待，未捕获异常会直接导致进程崩溃\n- **修复:** 非事件处理方法请改为返回 `async Task`。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosNotificationCenterDelegate.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 118
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 35,
                  "endLine": 64,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "public override async void DidReceiveNotificationResponse(\n        UNUserNotificationCenter center,\n        UNNotificationResponse response,\n        Action completionHandler)\n    {\n        try\n        {\n            if (ToastService?.HandleResponse(response) == true)\n            {\n                return;\n            }\n\n            var uri = await IosNotificationActions.HandleResponseAsync(\n                center,\n                response,\n                NotificationMutationGate);\n            if (uri != null)\n            {\n                NavigationRequested?.Invoke(uri);\n            }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 35,
                  "endLine": 64,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +34,32 @@\n+\n+    public override async void DidReceiveNotificationResponse(\n+        UNUserNotificationCenter center,\n+        UNNotificationResponse response,\n+        Action completionHandler)\n+    {\n+        try\n+        {\n+            if (ToastService?.HandleResponse(response) == true)\n+            {\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            var uri = await IosNotificationActions.HandleResponseAsync(\n+                center,\n+                response,\n+                NotificationMutationGate);\n+            if (uri != null)\n+            {\n+                NavigationRequested?.Invoke(uri);\n+            }\n+        }\n+        catch (Exception exception)\n+        {\n+            Console.Error.WriteLine($\"处理 iOS 通知操作时发生异常：{exception}\");\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            completionHandler();\n+        }\n+    }\n+}"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "DidReceiveNotificationResponse",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Notifications/IosNotificationCenterDelegate.cs::DidReceiveNotificationResponse",
                  "kind": "function"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
