        {
          "ruleId": "CPS009",
          "ruleIndex": 8,
          "level": "note",
          "rank": 7.83,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] StartHudWatchdog — CPS=91.4% (C=90.8%, P=92.0%). 事件 `_hudWatchdogTimer.Tick +=` 绑定了匿名函数，后续无法解绑（`-=`） 修复: 改用具名方法并在销毁时执行 `-=` 解绑。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `StartHudWatchdog` (`ClassIsland.iOS/AppDelegate.cs:L433-L457`) · **CPS `91.4%`** (C `90.8%`, P `92.0%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 事件 `_hudWatchdogTimer.Tick +=` 绑定了匿名函数，后续无法解绑（`-=`）\n- **修复:** 改用具名方法并在销毁时执行 `-=` 解绑。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/AppDelegate.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 104
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 433,
                  "endLine": 457,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void StartHudWatchdog()\n    {\n        _hudWatchdogTimer = new DispatcherTimer\n        {\n            Interval = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(3)\n        };\n        _hudWatchdogTimer.Tick += (_, _) =>\n        {\n            try\n            {\n                // HUD 进程是主进程 spawn 出来的；主进程退出后由 launchd 收养，此时应自行退出避免孤儿悬浮窗。\n                if (getppid() == 1)\n                {\n                    IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"HUD parent process exited; terminating HUD process\");\n                    _hudWatchdogTimer?.Stop();\n                    Environment.Exit(0);\n                }\n            }\n            catch (Exception exception)\n            {"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 433,
                  "endLine": 457,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +432,27 @@\n+\n+    private void StartHudWatchdog()\n+    {\n+        _hudWatchdogTimer = new DispatcherTimer\n+        {\n+            Interval = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(3)\n+        };\n+        _hudWatchdogTimer.Tick += (_, _) =>\n+        {\n+            try\n+            {\n+                // HUD 进程是主进程 spawn 出来的；主进程退出后由 launchd 收养，此时应自行退出避免孤儿悬浮窗。\n+                if (getppid() == 1)\n+                {\n+                    IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"HUD parent process exited; terminating HUD process\");\n+                    _hudWatchdogTimer?.Stop();\n+                    Environment.Exit(0);\n+                }\n+            }\n+            catch (Exception exception)\n+            {\n+                IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"HUD watchdog failed\", exception);\n+            }\n+        };\n+        _hudWatchdogTimer.Start();\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "StartHudWatchdog",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.iOS/AppDelegate.cs::StartHudWatchdog",
                  "kind": "function"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
