            "markdown": "**提示** — `RunApplication` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Main.cs:L81-L88`) · **CPS `91.4%`** (C `90.3%`, P `92.6%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 事件 `ObjCRuntime.Runtime.MarshalManagedException +=` 绑定了匿名函数，后续无法解绑（`-=`）\n- **修复:** 改用具名方法并在销毁时执行 `-=` 解绑。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Main.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 108
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 81,
                  "endLine": 88,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "[MethodImpl(MethodImplOptions.NoInlining)]\n    private static void RunApplication(string[] args)\n    {\n        ObjCRuntime.Runtime.MarshalManagedException += (_, eventArgs) =>\n            IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"Managed exception crossing native boundary\", eventArgs.Exception);\n        IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"Starting UIApplication\");\n        UIApplication.Main(args, null, typeof(AppDelegate));\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 81,
                  "endLine": 88,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +80,10 @@\n+    // 将 UIKit 和 AppDelegate 的类型加载留在日志初始化之后。\n+    [MethodImpl(MethodImplOptions.NoInlining)]\n+    private static void RunApplication(string[] args)\n+    {\n+        ObjCRuntime.Runtime.MarshalManagedException += (_, eventArgs) =>\n+            IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"Managed exception crossing native boundary\", eventArgs.Exception);\n+        IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"Starting UIApplication\");\n+        UIApplication.Main(args, null, typeof(AppDelegate));\n+    }\n+}"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
