            "text": "[提示] RunMainViewCommand — CPS=91.5% (C=90.8%, P=92.3%). 调度的异步匿名函数 `Post(async () => ...)` 等效于 `async void` 修复: 在回调内部补充 `try/catch` 或改用返回 `Task` 的 `InvokeAsync`。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `RunMainViewCommand` (`ClassIsland.iOS/AppDelegate.SystemIntegration.cs:L195-L199`) · **CPS `91.5%`** (C `90.8%`, P `92.3%`, 权重 `0.0%`)\n- **问题:** 调度的异步匿名函数 `Post(async () => ...)` 等效于 `async void`\n- **修复:** 在回调内部补充 `try/catch` 或改用返回 `Task` 的 `InvokeAsync`。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/AppDelegate.SystemIntegration.cs",
