          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] StartFitTimer — CPS=91.5% (C=90.5%, P=92.5%). 事件 `_fitTimer.Tick +=` 绑定了匿名函数，后续无法解绑（`-=`） 修复: 改用具名方法并在销毁时执行 `-=` 解绑。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `StartFitTimer` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Controls/IosHudHost.axaml.cs:L111-L121`) · **CPS `91.5%`** (C `90.5%`, P `92.5%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 事件 `_fitTimer.Tick +=` 绑定了匿名函数，后续无法解绑（`-=`）\n- **修复:** 改用具名方法并在销毁时执行 `-=` 解绑。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Controls/IosHudHost.axaml.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 105
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 111,
                  "endLine": 121,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void StartFitTimer()\n    {\n        _fitTimer?.Stop();\n        _fitTimer = new DispatcherTimer\n        {\n            Interval = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(FitCheckIntervalSeconds)\n        };\n        _fitTimer.Tick += (_, _) => UpdateFitScale();\n        _fitTimer.Start();\n        UpdateFitScale();\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 111,
                  "endLine": 121,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +110,13 @@\n+\n+    private void StartFitTimer()\n+    {\n+        _fitTimer?.Stop();\n+        _fitTimer = new DispatcherTimer\n+        {\n+            Interval = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(FitCheckIntervalSeconds)\n+        };\n+        _fitTimer.Tick += (_, _) => UpdateFitScale();\n+        _fitTimer.Start();\n+        UpdateFitScale();\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
