            "text": "[提示] GetLocationAsync — CPS=91.5% (C=92.2%, P=90.8%). 疑似重复实现：`GetLocationAsync` 与上游 `GetLocationAsync` (`platforms/ClassIsland.Platforms.Windows/Services/LocationService.cs:L10-L41`) 相似度 92.9% 修复: 建议直接复用或扩展 `platforms/ClassIsland.Platforms.Windows/Services/LocationService.cs` 中的 `GetLocationAsync`。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `GetLocationAsync` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Platform/IosLocationService.cs:L26-L50`) · **CPS `91.5%`** (C `92.2%`, P `90.8%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 疑似重复实现：`GetLocationAsync` 与上游 `GetLocationAsync` (`platforms/ClassIsland.Platforms.Windows/Services/LocationService.cs:L10-L41`) 相似度 92.9%\n- **修复:** 建议直接复用或扩展 `platforms/ClassIsland.Platforms.Windows/Services/LocationService.cs` 中的 `GetLocationAsync`。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Platform/IosLocationService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 132
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 26,
                  "endLine": 50,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "public async Task<LocationCoordinate> GetLocationAsync()\n    {\n        await _applicationReady.Task.ConfigureAwait(false);\n        var request = new LocationRequest();\n        UIApplication.SharedApplication.BeginInvokeOnMainThread(request.Start);\n\n        try\n        {\n            var completedTask = await Task.WhenAny(\n                    request.Completion,\n                    Task.Delay(LocationTimeout))\n                .ConfigureAwait(false);\n\n            if (completedTask != request.Completion)\n            {\n                request.Fail(new TimeoutException(\"获取当前位置超时，请检查定位服务是否可用后重试。\"));\n            }\n\n            return await request.Completion.ConfigureAwait(false);\n        }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 26,
                  "endLine": 50,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +25,27 @@\n+\n+    public async Task<LocationCoordinate> GetLocationAsync()\n+    {\n+        await _applicationReady.Task.ConfigureAwait(false);\n+        var request = new LocationRequest();\n+        UIApplication.SharedApplication.BeginInvokeOnMainThread(request.Start);\n+\n+        try\n+        {\n+            var completedTask = await Task.WhenAny(\n+                    request.Completion,\n+                    Task.Delay(LocationTimeout))\n+                .ConfigureAwait(false);\n+\n+            if (completedTask != request.Completion)\n+            {\n+                request.Fail(new TimeoutException(\"获取当前位置超时，请检查定位服务是否可用后重试。\"));\n+            }\n+\n+            return await request.Completion.ConfigureAwait(false);\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            await request.StopAsync().ConfigureAwait(false);\n+        }\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
