          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] ShowPreviewNotification — CPS=91.6% (C=91.1%, P=92.2%). 未跟踪异步调用 `_ = ShowNotificationSafeAsync(...)` 的任务状态与异常 修复: 保存 `Task` 引用以便退出时等待，并确保 `ShowNotificationSafeAsync` 内部捕获异常。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `ShowPreviewNotification` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudPreviewNotificationPoller.cs:L145-L158`) · **CPS `91.6%`** (C `91.1%`, P `92.2%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 未跟踪异步调用 `_ = ShowNotificationSafeAsync(...)` 的任务状态与异常\n- **修复:** 保存 `Task` 引用以便退出时等待，并确保 `ShowNotificationSafeAsync` 内部捕获异常。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudPreviewNotificationPoller.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 123
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 145,
                  "endLine": 158,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private static void ShowPreviewNotification(NotificationActionSettings settings)\n    {\n        var provider = IAppHost.Host?.Services.GetServices<IHostedService>()\n            .OfType<ActionNotificationProvider>()\n            .FirstOrDefault();\n        if (provider == null)\n        {\n            IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"悬浮岛提醒预览失败：找不到行动提醒提供方\");\n            return;\n        }\n\n        IosStartupDiagnostics.Write($\"悬浮岛显示预览提醒：{settings.Mask}\");\n        _ = ShowNotificationSafeAsync(provider, NotificationAction.BuildNotificationRequest(settings));\n    }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 145,
                  "endLine": 158,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +144,16 @@\n+\n+    private static void ShowPreviewNotification(NotificationActionSettings settings)\n+    {\n+        var provider = IAppHost.Host?.Services.GetServices<IHostedService>()\n+            .OfType<ActionNotificationProvider>()\n+            .FirstOrDefault();\n+        if (provider == null)\n+        {\n+            IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"悬浮岛提醒预览失败：找不到行动提醒提供方\");\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        IosStartupDiagnostics.Write($\"悬浮岛显示预览提醒：{settings.Mask}\");\n+        _ = ShowNotificationSafeAsync(provider, NotificationAction.BuildNotificationRequest(settings));\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
