            "markdown": "**提示** — `TryDeleteDirectory` (`ClassIsland.Platforms.Abstractions/Services/StorageItemMaterializer.cs:L340-L350`) · **CPS `91.7%`** (C `90.6%`, P `92.8%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 裸 `catch` 或宽泛 `catch` 捕获了全部异常\n- **修复:** 改为捕获具体异常类型，避免吞掉非预期错误。"
