        {
          "ruleId": "CPS009",
          "ruleIndex": 8,
          "level": "note",
          "rank": 7.56,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] ShowViewCore — CPS=91.7% (C=94.0%, P=89.4%). 新增抛出异常（`InvalidOperationException`），可能影响 3 个上游调用方 修复: 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `ShowViewCore` (`ClassIsland/Controls/UI/MobileViewHost.axaml.cs:L607-L650`) · **CPS `91.7%`** (C `94.0%`, P `89.4%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 新增抛出异常（`InvalidOperationException`），可能影响 3 个上游调用方\n- **修复:** 确认上游调用方已处理该异常或补充说明。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Controls/UI/MobileViewHost.axaml.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 152
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 607,
                  "endLine": 650,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private async Task ShowViewCore(ViewBase view, ViewBase? owner, bool modal)\n    {\n        if (_isClosed)\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n        if (!ActivatedViews.Contains(view))\n        {\n            throw new InvalidOperationException(\"视图必须已经激活到此视图宿主才能显示。\");\n        }\n\n        if (owner is { AssociatedViewHost: null })\n        {\n            throw new InvalidOperationException(\"视图所有者必须已经激活到此视图宿主才能显示。\");\n        }\n\n        if (!_isShowed)\n        {\n            Show(owner?.AssociatedViewHost, modal);\n        }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 607,
                  "endLine": 650,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +606,46 @@\n+\n+    private async Task ShowViewCore(ViewBase view, ViewBase? owner, bool modal)\n+    {\n+        if (_isClosed)\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+        if (!ActivatedViews.Contains(view))\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException(\"视图必须已经激活到此视图宿主才能显示。\");\n+        }\n+\n+        if (owner is { AssociatedViewHost: null })\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException(\"视图所有者必须已经激活到此视图宿主才能显示。\");\n+        }\n+\n+        if (!_isShowed)\n+        {\n+            Show(owner?.AssociatedViewHost, modal);\n+        }\n+\n+        Activate();\n+        var isFirstViewShowed = _isFirstViewShowed;\n+        await RunNavigationWithProgressAsync(async () =>\n+        {\n+            if (isFirstViewShowed)\n+            {\n+                await NavigationPage.PushAsync(view);\n+            }\n+            else\n+            {\n+                await NavigationPage.ReplaceAsync(view);\n+            }\n+        });\n+        if (_isClosed)\n+        {\n+            return;"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "ShowViewCore",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland/Controls/UI/MobileViewHost.axaml.cs::ShowViewCore",
                  "kind": "function"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
