        {
          "ruleId": "CPS005",
          "ruleIndex": 4,
          "level": "note",
          "rank": 7.37,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] HideView — CPS=91.9% (C=94.4%, P=89.5%). 疑似重复实现：`HideView` 与上游 `HideView` (`ClassIsland.Android/Controls/UI/AndroidViewHost.axaml.cs:L659-L692`) 相似度 98.6% 重复函数签名：`public async Task<bool> HideView(ViewBase view)` 与上游 `HideView` (`ClassIsland.Android/Controls/UI/AndroidViewHost.axaml.cs:L659-L692`) 冲突 修复: 建议直接复用或扩展 `ClassIsland.Android/Controls/UI/AndroidViewHost.axaml.cs` 中的 `HideView`。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `HideView` (`ClassIsland/Controls/UI/MobileViewHost.axaml.cs:L667-L707`) · **CPS `91.9%`** (C `94.4%`, P `89.5%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 疑似重复实现：`HideView` 与上游 `HideView` (`ClassIsland.Android/Controls/UI/AndroidViewHost.axaml.cs:L659-L692`) 相似度 98.6%\n- **问题:** 重复函数签名：`public async Task<bool> HideView(ViewBase view)` 与上游 `HideView` (`ClassIsland.Android/Controls/UI/AndroidViewHost.axaml.cs:L659-L692`) 冲突\n- **修复:** 建议直接复用或扩展 `ClassIsland.Android/Controls/UI/AndroidViewHost.axaml.cs` 中的 `HideView`。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Controls/UI/MobileViewHost.axaml.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 152
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 667,
                  "endLine": 707,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "public async Task<bool> HideView(ViewBase view)\n    {\n        if (_isClosed)\n        {\n            return false;\n        }\n        if (DrawerActivatedViews.Contains(view))\n        {\n            return await DrawerHost.HideView(view);\n        }\n\n        if (!ActivatedViews.Contains(view))\n        {\n            throw new InvalidOperationException(\"视图必须已经激活才能隐藏。\");\n        }\n\n        if (!Equals(NavigationPage.CurrentPage, view))\n        {\n            return false;\n        }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 667,
                  "endLine": 707,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +666,43 @@\n+\n+    public async Task<bool> HideView(ViewBase view)\n+    {\n+        if (_isClosed)\n+        {\n+            return false;\n+        }\n+        if (DrawerActivatedViews.Contains(view))\n+        {\n+            return await DrawerHost.HideView(view);\n+        }\n+\n+        if (!ActivatedViews.Contains(view))\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException(\"视图必须已经激活才能隐藏。\");\n+        }\n+\n+        if (!Equals(NavigationPage.CurrentPage, view))\n+        {\n+            return false;\n+        }\n+\n+        if (NavigationPage.Pages?.Count() <= 1)\n+        {\n+            if (!view.ViewDeactivating(WindowCloseReason.Undefined, true, true))\n+            {\n+                return false;\n+            }\n+\n+            if (ActivatedViews.Remove(view))\n+            {\n+                view.ViewDeactivated();\n+            }\n+            Hide();\n+        }\n+        else\n+        {\n+            await RunNavigationWithProgressAsync(() => NavigationPage.PopAsync());"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "HideView",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland/Controls/UI/MobileViewHost.axaml.cs::HideView",
                  "kind": "function"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
