            "text": "[提示] ShowRestartDialog — CPS=92.4% (C=93.5%, P=91.3%). `async void ShowRestartDialog(...)` 无法被等待，未捕获异常会直接导致进程崩溃 修复: 非事件处理方法请改为返回 `async Task`。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `ShowRestartDialog` (`ClassIsland/Views/SettingsWindowNew.axaml.cs:L667-L691`) · **CPS `92.4%`** (C `93.5%`, P `91.3%`, 权重 `0.0%`)\n- **问题:** `async void ShowRestartDialog(...)` 无法被等待，未捕获异常会直接导致进程崩溃\n- **修复:** 非事件处理方法请改为返回 `async Task`。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland/Views/SettingsWindowNew.axaml.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 202
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 667,
                  "endLine": 691,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private async void ShowRestartDialog()\n    {\n        if (PlatformHelper.IsAppleMobile)\n        {\n            AppBase.Current.Restart();\n            return;\n        }\n\n        if (!IsShowingRestartDialog)\n        {\n            IsShowingRestartDialog = true;\n            var r = await new FAContentDialog()\n            {\n                Title = \"需要重启\",\n                Content = \"部分设置需要重启以应用更改。\",\n                PrimaryButtonText = \"重启\",\n                CloseButtonText = \"取消\",\n                DefaultButton = FAContentDialogButton.Primary,\n            }.ShowAsyncAuto(TopLevel.GetTopLevel(this));\n            IsShowingRestartDialog = false;"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 667,
                  "endLine": 691,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -665,6 +666,12 @@ public partial class SettingsWindowNew : ViewBase, IFANavigationPageFactory\n     bool IsShowingRestartDialog = false;\n     private async void ShowRestartDialog()\n     {\n+        if (PlatformHelper.IsAppleMobile)\n+        {\n+            AppBase.Current.Restart();\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n         if (!IsShowingRestartDialog)\n         {\n             IsShowingRestartDialog = true;"
                  }
                }
              },
