          "rank": 6.83,
          "message": {
            "text": "[提示] ScheduleHudLivenessCheck — CPS=92.5% (C=93.2%, P=91.9%). 事件 `_livenessTimer.Tick +=` 绑定了匿名函数，后续无法解绑（`-=`） 修复: 改用具名方法并在销毁时执行 `-=` 解绑。",
            "markdown": "**提示** — `ScheduleHudLivenessCheck` (`ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudOverlayService.cs:L169-L197`) · **CPS `92.5%`** (C `93.2%`, P `91.9%`, 权重 `0.1%`)\n- **问题:** 事件 `_livenessTimer.Tick +=` 绑定了匿名函数，后续无法解绑（`-=`）\n- **修复:** 改用具名方法并在销毁时执行 `-=` 解绑。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudOverlayService.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%",
                  "index": 122
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 169,
                  "endLine": 197,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "private void ScheduleHudLivenessCheck()\n    {\n        _livenessTimer?.Stop();\n        _livenessTimer = new DispatcherTimer\n        {\n            Interval = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(2)\n        };\n        _livenessTimer.Tick += (_, _) =>\n        {\n            _livenessTimer?.Stop();\n            _livenessTimer = null;\n            if (!_isEnabled)\n            {\n                return;\n            }\n\n            if (IosHudNativeBridge.IsRunning() == 1)\n            {\n                return;\n            }"
                  }
                },
                "contextRegion": {
                  "startLine": 169,
                  "endLine": 197,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "@@ -0,1 +168,31 @@\n+    /// </summary>\n+    private void ScheduleHudLivenessCheck()\n+    {\n+        _livenessTimer?.Stop();\n+        _livenessTimer = new DispatcherTimer\n+        {\n+            Interval = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(2)\n+        };\n+        _livenessTimer.Tick += (_, _) =>\n+        {\n+            _livenessTimer?.Stop();\n+            _livenessTimer = null;\n+            if (!_isEnabled)\n+            {\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            if (IosHudNativeBridge.IsRunning() == 1)\n+            {\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            IosStartupDiagnostics.Write(\"HUD 子进程在启动后退出；已自动关闭悬浮主界面开关\");\n+            _isEnabled = false;\n+            UnsubscribeConfigurationChanges();\n+            PersistSetting(false);\n+            PropertyChanged?.Invoke(this, new PropertyChangedEventArgs(nameof(IsEnabled)));\n+        };\n+        _livenessTimer.Start();\n+    }\n+"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "ScheduleHudLivenessCheck",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "ClassIsland.iOS/Services/Overlay/IosHudOverlayService.cs::ScheduleHudLivenessCheck",
                  "kind": "function"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
